lls on AWS that bypass all curl timeout flags.\n\nSolution: rewrote the entire module as audit.js (Node.js).\n- Zero network calls — all checks are local filesystem + exec\n- Uses execSync with stdio pipe (no shell blocking)\n- Completes in <1 second guaranteed\n- Still shows all 8 sections with same output format\n- Exits 0 always","tree":{"sha":"7f1c3130034c1c344516a6bf69b7dc47841f6fc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/trees/7f1c3130034c1c344516a6bf69b7dc47841f6fc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/commits/3fc124d89342d38677025069016717f60b10f6cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen","id":156820375,"login":"nextgensoumen","node_id":"U_kgDOCVjjlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/3fc124d89342d38677025069016717f60b10f6cd","node_id":"C_kwDOSIhlatoAKDNmYzEyNGQ4OTM0MmQzODY3NzAyNTA2OTAxNjcxN2Y2MGIxMGY2Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/65c62bcf527496321b95e7944324acf7f3fbc4d8","sha":"65c62bcf527496321b95e7944324acf7f3fbc4d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/65c62bcf527496321b95e7944324acf7f3fbc4d8"}],"sha":"3fc124d89342d38677025069016717f60b10f6cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/3fc124d89342d38677025069016717f60b10f6cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen","id":156820375,"login":"nextgensoumen","node_id":"U_kgDOCVjjlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/65c62bcf527496321b95e7944324acf7f3fbc4d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T02:29:02Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T02:29:02Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"message":"fix(ssl-module): skip ALL network checks in headless mode — final fix\n\nPrevious fix only skipped the ACME curl but validate_ip + ss could\nstill hang. Now in headless mode: entire network section returns early\nwith static status messages. No curl, no DNS, no ss.\n\nAlso added --max-time 8 to PUBLIC_IP curl calls in detect_os().","tree":{"sha":"3db18f520a974bb95b9bf1ae8c9286a59b443c8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/trees/3db18f520a974bb95b9bf1ae8c9286a59b443c8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/commits/65c62bcf527496321b95e7944324acf7f3fbc4d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen","id":156820375,"login":"nextgensoumen","node_id":"U_kgDOCVjjlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/65c62bcf527496321b95e7944324acf7f3fbc4d8","node_id":"C_kwDOSIhlatoAKDY1YzYyYmNmNTI3NDk2MzIxYjk1ZTc5NDQzMjRhY2Y3ZjNmYmM0ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/431180c9004a06f496b15053adcd72a0e07118d2","sha":"431180c9004a06f496b15053adcd72a0e07118d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/431180c9004a06f496b15053adcd72a0e07118d2"}],"sha":"65c62bcf527496321b95e7944324acf7f3fbc4d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/65c62bcf527496321b95e7944324acf7f3fbc4d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen","id":156820375,"login":"nextgensoumen","node_id":"U_kgDOCVjjlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/431180c9004a06f496b15053adcd72a0e07118d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T02:25:11Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T02:25:11Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"message":"fix(ssl-module): skip ACME curl in headless mode — DNS stall on AWS\n\nRoot cause: DNS for acme-staging-v02.api.letsencrypt.org stalls\nat libc level on AWS, ignoring both --connect-timeout and --max-time.\n\nFix: when SOC_PULSE_HEADLESS=true (set by moduleRunner), skip the\nlive ACME connectivity check entirely and log ''skipped in audit mode''.\nThe check is useless in audit mode anyway — we are only checking config.","tree":{"sha":"c9fa6a043c60fdf41682bb59133370b531ae9594","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/trees/c9fa6a043c60fdf41682bb59133370b531ae9594"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/commits/431180c9004a06f496b15053adcd72a0e07118d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen","id":156820375,"login":"nextgensoumen","node_id":"U_kgDOCVjjlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/431180c9004a06f496b15053adcd72a0e07118d2","node_id":"C_kwDOSIhlatoAKDQzMTE4MGM5MDA0YTA2ZjQ5NmIxNTA1M2FkY2Q3MmEwZTA3MTE4ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/58f6727c9d86b05daca5050accd13bb0173d71cb","sha":"58f6727c9d86b05daca5050accd13bb0173d71cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/58f6727c9d86b05daca5050accd13bb0173d71cb"}],"sha":"431180c9004a06f496b15053adcd72a0e07118d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/431180c9004a06f496b15053adcd72a0e07118d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen","id":156820375,"login":"nextgensoumen","node_id":"U_kgDOCVjjlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/58f6727c9d86b05daca5050accd13bb0173d71cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T02:20:44Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T02:20:44Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"message":"fix(ssl-module): add --max-time to curl to prevent step 6 hang\n\nStep 6/8 (Network check) was hanging because curl was connecting\nto ACME staging server with only --connect-timeout but no --max-time.\nTCP stall on AWS caused infinite wait.\n\nFix: added --max-time 8 (and --max-time 6 in integrity-check)\nto hard-kill the curl request if it exceeds the max time.","tree":{"sha":"e63435496fb590e5acc30d4d4631a80705c14c46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/trees/e63435496fb590e5acc30d4d4631a80705c14c46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/commits/58f6727c9d86b05daca5050accd13bb0173d71cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen","id":156820375,"login":"nextgensoumen","node_id":"U_kgDOCVjjlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/58f6727c9d86b05daca5050accd13bb0173d71cb","node_id":"C_kwDOSIhlatoAKDU4ZjY3MjdjOWQ4NmIwNWRhY2E1MDUwYWNjZDEzYmIwMTczZDcxY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/a84530114a0744d605d3368db6055421ae7524c3","sha":"a84530114a0744d605d3368db6055421ae7524c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/a84530114a0744d605d3368db6055421ae7524c3"}],"sha":"58f6727c9d86b05daca5050accd13bb0173d71cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/58f6727c9d86b05daca5050accd13bb0173d71cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen","id":156820375,"login":"nextgensoumen","node_id":"U_kgDOCVjjlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/a84530114a0744d605d3368db6055421ae7524c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T02:15:02Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T02:15:02Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"message":"fix(ssl-module): exit code 1 now shows Completed not Failed\n\nRoot cause: SSL manager exits code 1 when certbot not installed.\nmoduleRunner treated any non-zero exit as Failed.\n\nFix:\n1. modules.registry.js: added allowedExitCodes: [1] to Module 5\n2. moduleRunner.js: checks allowedExitCodes before setting status\n3. api.js: passes full module config object to runModule\n\nLive test results (AWS Ubuntu 22.04):\n- Supply Chain Defense: CLEAN (202 deps)\n- Web App Scanner: CLEAN (CVE-2025-55182 not vulnerable)\n- System Endpoint Hardening: COMPLETED (510s, 10/11 controls)\n- Autonomous CVE Remediation: PATCHED (PwnKit + regreSSHion auto-fixed)\n- Machine IP Cryptography: COMPLETED (audit mode, certbot not installed)","tree":{"sha":"9beb4eb3dd641dc504c9a048641eff97917b6e7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/trees/9beb4eb3dd641dc504c9a048641eff97917b6e7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/commits/a84530114a0744d605d3368db6055421ae7524c3","verification":{"pa