gensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/4cb2c71c34328ce5173bc9b1d6cdd00d3bb595cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T01:48:58Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T01:48:58Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"message":"fix(launcher): bulletproof v3.0 — eliminates all recurring issues\n\nROOT CAUSES FIXED:\n1. curl pipe error (curl: (23) Failed writing body):\n   - OLD: curl ... | bash  (pipe breaks when apt output interferes)\n   - NEW: curl -o /tmp/node_setup.sh && bash /tmp/node_setup.sh\n   - Result: NodeSource installs to /usr/bin/node (no snap needed)\n\n2. pm2 daemon can''t find snap node:\n   - OLD: relied on PATH lookup — pm2 daemon has no /snap/bin\n   - NEW: ln -sf NODE_BIN /usr/local/bin/node (always, unconditionally)\n   - NEW: pm2 start --interpreter NODE_BIN (full path, no lookup)\n   - NEW: all npm calls use /usr/local/bin/npm (full path)\n\n3. Port conflicts on re-run:\n   - NEW: fuser -k 5000/tcp + fuser -k 5173/tcp before launch\n\n4. set -e aborting on non-fatal errors:\n   - OLD: set -euo pipefail (any non-zero aborts whole script)\n   - NEW: set -uo pipefail (errors handled per-command with || true)\n\n5. Health check failure is silent:\n   - OLD: just a warning message\n   - NEW: shows last 20 lines of backend-err.log + backend-out.log","tree":{"sha":"271aaa4486a2c1a4fe3122afa6219cdcde2b9c05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/trees/271aaa4486a2c1a4fe3122afa6219cdcde2b9c05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/commits/4cb2c71c34328ce5173bc9b1d6cdd00d3bb595cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","foll