ws machine — bash modules failed due to WSL,\nNode scanners failed due to missing dist/. Cloud Ubuntu will write real records.","tree":{"sha":"351548820ae35e4a06556a643b25ddcf7eaf3dcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/trees/351548820ae35e4a06556a643b25ddcf7eaf3dcc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/commits/c35810b6897d2a773602e12d0a146f0530a4487d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen","id":156820375,"login":"nextgensoumen","node_id":"U_kgDOCVjjlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/c35810b6897d2a773602e12d0a146f0530a4487d","node_id":"C_kwDOSIhlatoAKGMzNTgxMGI2ODk3ZDJhNzczNjAyZTEyZDBhMTQ2ZjA1MzBhNDQ4N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/d13b5131541a3498757abf069683008c9ec79255","sha":"d13b5131541a3498757abf069683008c9ec79255","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/d13b5131541a3498757abf069683008c9ec79255"}],"sha":"c35810b6897d2a773602e12d0a146f0530a4487d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/c35810b6897d2a773602e12d0a146f0530a4487d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen","id":156820375,"login":"nextgensoumen","node_id":"U_kgDOCVjjlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/d13b5131541a3498757abf069683008c9ec79255/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T00:47:38Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T00:47:38Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"message":"feat(backend): full power upgrade v2.0\n\nMODULE RUNNER (moduleRunner.js):\n- Per-module configurable timeout (registry timeoutSeconds — default 30min)\n- SIGTERM → SIGKILL escalation after 5s (handles bash scripts ignoring SIGTERM)\n- Line-buffered stdout (no more partial lines in log_stream events)\n- 2000-line memory cap per module (prevents OOM on 45min hardening runs)\n- NEEDRESTART_MODE + extended PATH in all child envs\n- getActiveList() export for new /api/modules/active endpoint\n\nSCAN HISTORY (scanHistory.js):\n- Atomic writes via tmp file → rename (no JSON corruption on crash)\n- In-memory LRU cache (O(1) reads — no disk I/O per API call)\n- Threat verdict extraction from log output (VULNERABLE/PATCHED/CLEAN/ERROR)\n- Per-module stats: totalRuns, successRate, avgDuration, lastVerdict\n- getPlatformStats(): cross-module threat aggregation\n- 500-record disk cap, 200-record memory cap (was 100/in-memory-only)\n\nLOGGER (logger.js):\n- File logging to logs/backend.log (persists across pm2 restarts)\n- 10MB log rotation (renames to .1, creates fresh file)\n- request() level for HTTP access logs\n- Streaming write stream (non-blocking file I/O)\n\nAPI ROUTES (api.js):\n- GET /api/modules/active (running module IDs)\n- GET /api/modules/stats (platform threat metrics)\n- GET /api/modules/:id (single module detail + stats)\n- GET /api/modules/:id/stats (per-module run statistics)\n- ?limit query param on all history endpoints (max 200)\n- Full module metadata (description, threatLevel, stats) in list response\n- timeoutSeconds forwarded from registry → runner\n\nREGISTRY (modules.registry.js):\n- timeoutSeconds per module: Node=5min, CVE=30min, Hardening=45min, SSL=10min\n- Prevents hung modules from running forever in cloud\n\nSERVER (server.js):\n- GET /api/stats platform endpoint\n- Security headers (X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, X-XSS-Protection)\n- HTTP access logging (colorized status codes, response time)\n- Memory/CPU info in /api/system/info\n- 1MB request body limit\n- socket.emit(''connected'') handshake for client reconnect verification","tree":{"sha":"33d49d73fea6d2fcdef1d2d73ae2035207031f2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/trees/33d49d73fea6d2fcdef1d2d73ae2035207031f2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/commits/d13b5131541a3498757abf069683008c9ec79255","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"com