vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/9f13368652a9ef8587e822625821157181e1dc6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T00:34:25Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T00:34:25Z","email":"alpha14soumen@gmail.com","name":"Soumen Bhunia"},"message":"fix(cloud): full production hardening for any cloud/Ubuntu version\n\nDEPLOYMENT STABILITY:\n- soc-pulse-start.sh: root check, health-wait loop before dashboard, pm2 status summary\n- 02-install-dependencies.sh: DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive on ALL apt commands\n  (prevents kernel/grub interactive prompts from blocking forever on cloud VMs),\n  removed apt-get upgrade (was hanging 30min+), added jq/unzip, ansible pip3 fallback\n  for Ubuntu 20.04 where apt ansible is too old, added pm2 global install\n- 04-run-backend.sh: replaced naked ''npm start'' with pm2 (survives SSH disconnect,\n  auto-restarts on crash, max 10 retries, 2s restart delay, log files written)\n- 03-run-dashboard.sh: pm2 for dashboard too, auto-detects public IP for access URL\n\nWEBSOCKET STABILITY:\n- backend/server.js: pingInterval=25000 pingTimeout=60000 (AWS ALB idle-timeout fix),\n  upgradeTimeout=30000, maxHttpBufferSize=1MB, uncaughtException + unhandledRejection\n  guards (modules can no longer crash the server), graceful SIGTERM handler\n- dashboard/src/App.jsx: socket.io reconnection=true, 100 attempts, 1-30s\n  exponential backoff, 0.3 jitter, 20s timeout, websocket+polling transports\n\nNEW FILES:\n- ecosystem.config.cjs: pm2 ecosystem config (pm2 start ecosystem.config.cjs)\n- logs/.gitignore: logs/ dir exists in repo, *.log files excluded","tree":{"sha":"f33d1255a4f02e477d3b15a4aedb3af3fd49f7a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/trees/f33d1255a4f02e477d3b15a4aedb3af3fd49f7a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/git/commits/9f13368652a9ef8587e822625821157181e1dc6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156820375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen","id":156820375,"login":"nextgensoumen","node_id":"U_kgDOCVjjlw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nextgensoumen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/9f13368652a9ef8587e822625821157181e1dc6b","node_id":"C_kwDOSIhlatoAKDlmMTMzNjg2NTJhOWVmODU4N2U4MjI2MjU4MjExNTcxODFlMWRjNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commit/4e1c9efc033de4e0912ca5638726d05018c0aff3","sha":"4e1c9efc033de4e0912ca5638726d05018c0aff3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgensoumen/soc-pulse/commits/4e1c9efc033de4e0912ca5638726d05018c0aff3"}],"sha":"9f13368652a9ef8587e822625821157181e1dc6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextgen