:"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/52ed841f674220c3d37a7949e70cad0f0d6688fd"}],"sha":"278d68c0680a62a8d22ee9ba63662620aef4cef7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/278d68c0680a62a8d22ee9ba63662620aef4cef7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/52ed841f674220c3d37a7949e70cad0f0d6688fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:55:19Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:55:19Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"feat(entropy): add weekly scan script (todos + dead-code)\n\n- scans src/ for TODO/FIXME/XXX/HACK comments, adds git-blame age\n- uses knip to surface unused exports / dead code\n- outputs structured JSON to stdout, consumed by generate-tech-debt-pr.js\n  (Task 22) for weekly automated MR\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff6968ed5f8fe0d83be17c983bdb079e9cd18e2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/trees/ff6968ed5f8fe0d83be17c983bdb079e9cd18e2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/commits/52ed841f674220c3d37a7949e70cad0f0d6688fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/52ed841f674220c3d37a7949e70cad0f0d6688fd","node_id":"C_kwDOSIoIFNoAKDUyZWQ4NDFmNjc0MjIwYzNkMzdhNzk0OWU3MGNhZDBmMGQ2Njg4ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/426810bba9462e27e3d7ef184b52e6ac3ea8d3a9","sha":"426810bba9462e27e3d7ef184b52e6ac3ea8d3a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/426810bba9462e27e3d7ef184b52e6ac3ea8d3a9"}],"sha":"52ed841f674220c3d37a7949e70cad0f0d6688fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/52ed841f674220c3d37a7949e70cad0f0d6688fd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/426810bba9462e27e3d7ef184b52e6ac3ea8d3a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:52:42Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:52:42Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"docs: add prompts/ templates (page/service/store/component)\n\nValidated prompt templates for the 4 most common tasks. Teams copy\na template, replace the placeholders, and hand it to their AI\n(Claude Code / Cursor / Copilot / Codex). Each template includes\n背景 / 步骤 / 禁止 / 验收 / 参考 sections so the agent can''t\nsilently skip steps.\n\n- prompts/AGENTS.md — index + when to add/update templates\n- prompts/add-page.md — 加路由页面\n- prompts/add-service.md — 加 API 服务\n- prompts/add-store.md — 加 MobX Store\n- prompts/add-component.md — 加通用组件\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c037d4104354718e5fb0e8c2fa027415192eb69f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/trees/c037d4104354718e5fb0e8c2fa027415192eb69f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/commits/426810bba9462e27e3d7ef184b52e6ac3ea8d3a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/426810bba9462e27e3d7ef184b52e6ac3ea8d3a9","node_id":"C_kwDOSIoIFNoAKDQyNjgxMGJiYTk0NjJlMjdlM2Q3ZWYxODRiNTJlNmFjM2VhOGQzYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/227deec025e2d0da4f42359ae7087d2c16a32eb5","sha":"227deec025e2d0da4f42359ae7087d2c16a32eb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/227deec025e2d0da4f42359ae7087d2c16a32eb5"}],"sha":"426810bba9462e27e3d7ef184b52e6ac3ea8d3a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/426810bba9462e27e3d7ef184b52e6ac3ea8d3a9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/227deec025e2d0da4f42359ae7087d2c16a32eb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:50:31Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:50:31Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"chore: add husky pre-commit + lint-staged + prettier\n\n- .husky/pre-commit runs lint-staged on git commit.\n- lint-staged config: eslint + prettier on JS/JSX, prettier on SCSS/JSON.\n- No --max-warnings=0 flag; only error-level violations block commits\n  (per user preference for lenient first-rollout).\n- .prettierrc.json matches existing style: 4-space, single quotes,\n  no semi, no trailing comma.\n- ''prepare'': husky install auto-runs on yarn install.\n\nVerified: hook blocks on harness-local rule violations, allows clean commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30f9ec47f431a6ba5b41fa5fd1a12ba5dfc652e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/trees/30f9ec47f431a6ba5b41fa5fd1a12ba5dfc652e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/commits/227deec025e2d0da4f42359ae7087d2c16a32eb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/227deec025e2d0da4f42359ae7087d2c16a32eb5","node_id":"C_kwDOSIoIFNoAKDIyN2RlZWMwMjVlMmQwZGE0ZjQyMzU5YWU3MDg3ZDJjMTZhMzJlYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/d17114b5d28dc72f811f4ae408a568cdd4c250e9","sha":"d17114b5d28dc72f811f4ae408a568cdd4c250e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/d17114b5d28dc72f811f4ae408a568cdd4c250e9"}],"sha":"227deec025e2d0da4f42359ae7087d2c16a32eb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/227deec025e2d0da4f42359ae7087d2c16a32eb5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/d17114b5d28dc72f811f4ae408a568cdd4c250e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:45:15Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:45:15Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"ci: add GitLab pipeline (lint/structure/jscpd on MR)\n\nThree parallel quality jobs triggered on merge_request_event:\n- lint: yarn lint (fails on harness-local errors)\n- structure-tests: yarn test:structure (25 tests)\n- duplication: yarn dup:check (jscpd threshold 5%)\n\nAll share a cached node_modules install via the ''install'' stage.\nDuplication job preserves its markdown report as a 1-week artifact\nfor human review.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c92c634904da6bacc3ad79215cc09bfcae7ef0a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/trees/c92c634904da6bacc3ad79215cc09bfcae7ef0a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/commits/d17114b5d28dc72f811f4ae408a568cdd4c250e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/d17114b5d28dc72f811f4ae408a568cdd4c250e9","node_id":"C_kwDOSIoIFNoAKGQxNzExNGI1ZDI4ZGM3MmY4MTFmNGFlNDA4YTU2OGNkZDRjMjUwZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/0e13e48c2416db1c6bafc26e0adc6e78f4e501dc","sha":"0e13e48c2416db1c6bafc26e0adc6e78f4e501dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/0e13e48c2416db1c6bafc26e0adc6e78f4e501dc"}],"sha":"d17114b5d28dc72f811f4ae408a568cdd4c250e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/d17114b5d28dc72f811f4ae408a568cdd4c250e9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/0e13e48c2416db1c6bafc26e0adc6e78f4e501dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:44:09Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:44:09Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"fix(lint): add jest + node to env so yarn ci:quality passes\n\nApp.test.js uses Jest globals (test, expect) that were flagged as\nno-undef. Entropy scan script (scripts/entropy-scan.js, Task 21) also\nuses Node globals. Added jest and node to .eslintrc.js env block.\n\nyarn ci:quality now passes end-to-end (lint + test:structure + dup:check).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"512139faeab4cefbff4c7f6a0c97446c3c40de91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/trees/512139faeab4cefbff4c7f6a0c97446c3c40de91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/commits/0e13e48c2416db1c6bafc26e0adc6e78f4e501dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/0e13e48c2416db1c6bafc26e0adc6e78f4e501dc","node_id":"C_kwDOSIoIFNoAKDBlMTNlNDhjMjQxNmRiMWM2YmFmYzI2ZTBhZGM2ZTc4ZjRlNTAxZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/b7c8a1c8e0e17f9eb95da6ac9bed2a1a11f17223","sha":"b7c8a1c8e0e17f9eb95da6ac9bed2a1a11f17223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/b7c8a1c8e0e17f9eb95da6ac9bed2a1a11f17223"}],"sha":"0e13e48c2416db1c6bafc26e0adc6e78f4e501dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/0e13e48c2416db1c6bafc26e0adc6e78f4e501dc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/b7c8a1c8e0e17f9eb95da6ac9bed2a1a11f17223/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:43:17Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:43:17Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"fix(lint): drop orphaned react/* rules from .eslintrc.js\n\nWhen ''react'' plugin was removed from plugins array (to resolve craco\nbuild conflict), the rules referencing ''react/*'' were left in place.\nyarn lint on tools/ and tests/ (outside react-scripts'' scope) threw\n~895 ''Definition for rule not found'' errors.\n\nDrop all react/* rule entries. React linting for src/ is still\nprovided by the react-app preset via package.json eslintConfig when\ncraco builds. tools/ and tests/ don''t have JSX so don''t need react\nrules. Added a comment in .eslintrc.js explaining the decision.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84d861d132d2c5f0ad1a4c74c67aac4b43f29744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/trees/84d861d132d2c5f0ad1a4c74c67aac4b43f29744"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/commits/b7c8a1c8e0e17f9eb95da6ac9bed2a1a11f17223","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/b7c8a1c8e0e17f9eb95da6ac9bed2a1a11f17223","node_id":"C_kwDOSIoIFNoAKGI3YzhhMWM4ZTBlMTdmOWViOTVkYTZhYzliZWQyYTFhMTFmMTcyMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/517e76f28f0e498919f77f31b58e57c4d0929979","sha":"517e76f28f0e498919f77f31b58e57c4d0929979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/517e76f28f0e498919f77f31b58e57c4d0929979"}],"sha":"b7c8a1c8e0e17f9eb95da6ac9bed2a1a11f17223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/b7c8a1c8e0e17f9eb95da6ac9bed2a1a11f17223"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/517e76f28f0e498919f77f31b58e57c4d0929979/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:39:22Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:39:22Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"chore: add jscpd config + dup:check / ci:quality scripts\n\n- .jscpdrc.json: threshold 5%, min 10 lines / 70 tokens, covers\n  js/jsx/scss.\n- dup:check runs jscpd against src/.\n- ci:quality is the one-command local equivalent of the CI pipeline\n  (lint + test:structure + dup:check).\n- Added /report to .gitignore so jscpd output doesn''t leak into commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b794c353d494918db7bcdfe9f7415e17513182cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/trees/b794c353d494918db7bcdfe9f7415e17513182cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/commits/517e76f28f0e498919f77f31b58e57c4d0929979","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/517e76f28f0e498919f77f31b58e57c4d0929979","node_id":"C_kwDOSIoIFNoAKDUxN2U3NmYyOGYwZTQ5ODkxOWY3N2YzMWI1OGU1N2M0ZDA5Mjk5Nzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/8a673dec9ec22d12630b621ae179627e3e34b857","sha":"8a673dec9ec22d12630b621ae179627e3e34b857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/8a673dec9ec22d12630b621ae179627e3e34b857"}],"sha":"517e76f28f0e498919f77f31b58e57c4d0929979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/517e76f28f0e498919f77f31b58e57c4d0929979"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/8a673dec9ec22d12630b621ae179627e3e34b857/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:37:21Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:37:21Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"test(structure): add components + i18n consistency test\n\nPart A: each src/components/<dir> must have index.js or index.jsx,\nand any .scss file must be .module.scss (complements ESLint''s\ncomponent-folder-convention rule which only fires on imports, not\non orphaned files).\n\nPart B: src/i18n/en-US.js and zh-CN.js must have identical key\nsets at the top level — catches ''added one side forgot the other''\nerrors that render as missing translations at runtime.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"551f7d9a306e14cfdf40362debf9c1f9a539adab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/trees/551f7d9a306e14cfdf40362debf9c1f9a539adab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/commits/8a673dec9ec22d12630b621ae179627e3e34b857","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/8a673dec9ec22d12630b621ae179627e3e34b857","node_id":"C_kwDOSIoIFNoAKDhhNjczZGVjOWVjMjJkMTI2MzBiNjIxYWUxNzk2MjdlM2UzNGI4NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/2032e4e2be27459032d92f25935c2c5dfb30545b","sha":"2032e4e2be27459032d92f25935c2c5dfb30545b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/2032e4e2be27459032d92f25935c2c5dfb30545b"}],"sha":"8a673dec9ec22d12630b621ae179627e3e34b857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/8a673dec9ec22d12630b621ae179627e3e34b857"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/2032e4e2be27459032d92f25935c2c5dfb30545b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:35:10Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:35:10Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"test(structure): add services-structure consistency test\n\nAsserts each non-xhr domain dir under src/services/ is flat\n(no nested subdirs) and every .js file follows the xxxService.js\nnaming convention. Complements ESLint''s service-file-convention\nrule by catching structural anomalies (nesting, AGENTS.md as dir,\ndot-files).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f509f4ec64e47ec52e9d2e0c06bddd2fb51fa682","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/trees/f509f4ec64e47ec52e9d2e0c06bddd2fb51fa682"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/commits/2032e4e2be27459032d92f25935c2c5dfb30545b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/2032e4e2be27459032d92f25935c2c5dfb30545b","node_id":"C_kwDOSIoIFNoAKDIwMzJlNGUyYmUyNzQ1OTAzMmQ5MmYyNTkzNWMyYzVkZmIzMDU0NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/6f0f562c4b528c06681ee8413a74c63fc5ccaab3","sha":"6f0f562c4b528c06681ee8413a74c63fc5ccaab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/6f0f562c4b528c06681ee8413a74c63fc5ccaab3"}],"sha":"2032e4e2be27459032d92f25935c2c5dfb30545b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/2032e4e2be27459032d92f25935c2c5dfb30545b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/6f0f562c4b528c06681ee8413a74c63fc5ccaab3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:33:54Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:33:54Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"test(structure): add stores-registered consistency test\n\nAsserts every src/store/*.Store.js file is imported in\nsrc/store/index.js (the rootStore aggregator). Catches ''new store\nfile but forgot to register in rootStore'' errors at CI time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"927df958071b75bd640603c772a2344dfc472b75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/trees/927df958071b75bd640603c772a2344dfc472b75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/commits/6f0f562c4b528c06681ee8413a74c63fc5ccaab3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/6f0f562c4b528c06681ee8413a74c63fc5ccaab3","node_id":"C_kwDOSIoIFNoAKDZmMGY1NjJjNGI1MjhjMDY2ODFlZTg0MTNhNzRjNjNmYzVjY2FhYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/493e39fc2ed877c425ddd1af8724fc8d9fdff105","sha":"493e39fc2ed877c425ddd1af8724fc8d9fdff105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/493e39fc2ed877c425ddd1af8724fc8d9fdff105"}],"sha":"6f0f562c4b528c06681ee8413a74c63fc5ccaab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/6f0f562c4b528c06681ee8413a74c63fc5ccaab3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/493e39fc2ed877c425ddd1af8724fc8d9fdff105/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:32:57Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:32:57Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"chore: pin jest-environment-node@^30 to fix version mismatch\n\nPreviously worked around a jest 27/30 env mismatch (react-scripts\ninstalls jest@27, we depend on jest@30) with fragile path resolution.\nNow pins jest-environment-node@30 as a direct devDep so the normal\n''testEnvironment: node'' resolution finds the matching version.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"424661d98ba4adf4996b1c8ec7f57c1df8678902","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/trees/424661d98ba4adf4996b1c8ec7f57c1df8678902"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/git/commits/493e39fc2ed877c425ddd1af8724fc8d9fdff105","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/493e39fc2ed877c425ddd1af8724fc8d9fdff105","node_id":"C_kwDOSIoIFNoAKDQ5M2UzOWZjMmVkODc3YzQyNWRkZDFhZjg3MjRmYzhkOWZkZmYxMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commit/571165f8511700bd6823a70b76fa1fed207eccfc","sha":"571165f8511700bd6823a70b76fa1fed207eccfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/571165f8511700bd6823a70b76fa1fed207eccfc"}],"sha":"493e39fc2ed877c425ddd1af8724fc8d9fdff105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/493e39fc2ed877c425ddd1af8724fc8d9fdff105"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yuyouquan/HarnessFontCode/commits/571165f8511700bd6823a70b76fa1fed207eccfc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:31:35Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T11:31:35Z","email":"youquan.yu@transsion.com","name":"youquan.yu"},"message":"test(structure): add routes-vs-pages consistency test\n\nAsserts bidirectional consistency between src/pages/ folders and\nrouter/config.js lazy imports, catching ''new page but forgot to\nregister route'' and ''route references deleted page'' errors that\nESLint can''t see across files.\n\nAlso fixes jest.config.js to resolve jest-environment-node from jest-cli\nv30 (rather than the react-scripts v27 copy) to avoid a moduleMocker\n