"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt","id":448487,"login":"dschmidt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODQ4Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commit/80ba6628c85d7bcedca81ff8f12965fb0925c9c4","node_id":"C_kwDOSIuvnNoAKDgwYmE2NjI4Yzg1ZDdiY2VkY2E4MWZmOGYxMjk2NWZiMDkyNWM5YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commit/9743793b99fb65919dbfdf5ede91c97316c4f2f7","sha":"9743793b99fb65919dbfdf5ede91c97316c4f2f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commits/9743793b99fb65919dbfdf5ede91c97316c4f2f7"}],"sha":"80ba6628c85d7bcedca81ff8f12965fb0925c9c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commits/80ba6628c85d7bcedca81ff8f12965fb0925c9c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448487?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt","id":448487,"login":"dschmidt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODQ4Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commits/9743793b99fb65919dbfdf5ede91c97316c4f2f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T11:32:30Z","email":"dev@dominik-schmidt.de","name":"Dominik Schmidt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T11:32:30Z","email":"dev@dominik-schmidt.de","name":"Dominik Schmidt"},"message":"refactor: extract Subsonic envelope + error codes into proto subpackage\n\nThe envelope writer and error-code constants lived alongside the\ngenerated ServerInterface in package subsonic. That forced the auth\nmiddleware to hand-roll its Subsonic-formatted HMAC rejection body\n(since subsonic already imports internal/auth, it couldn''t import back\nfor writeError without a cycle).\n\nMoving envelope.go + errors.go into internal/subsonic/proto/ breaks the\nfalse cycle: the proto package has no dependency on the generated\ntypes, so auth can now use proto.WriteError directly. HMAC rejection\nmoves back into auth.Middleware where it belongs (it''s an auth concern,\nnot a routing concern), and the ugly string-concatenated JSON body is\ngone.\n\nPublic surface within the subsonic package changes:\n  writeError/writeOK/writeJSONError -> proto.WriteError/WriteOK/WriteJSONError\n  ErrXxx constants                  -> proto.ErrXxx\n\nNo behavioural change.","tree":{"sha":"8c0a0ac7c8f9c6d737a3a5c2ed45a18b3f4207c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/git/trees/8c0a0ac7c8f9c6d737a3a5c2ed45a18b3f4207c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/git/commits/9743793b99fb65919dbfdf5ede91c97316c4f2f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448487?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt","id":448487,"login":"dschmidt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODQ4Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commit/9743793b99fb65919dbfdf5ede91c97316c4f2f7","node_id":"C_kwDOSIuvnNoAKDk3NDM3OTNiOTlmYjY1OTE5ZGJmZGY1ZWRlOTFjOTczMTZjNGYyZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commit/72a150293402023123117137228a0e8d11601917","sha":"72a150293402023123117137228a0e8d11601917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commits/72a150293402023123117137228a0e8d11601917"}],"sha":"9743793b99fb65919dbfdf5ede91c97316c4f2f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commits/9743793b99fb65919dbfdf5ede91c97316c4f2f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448487?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt","id":448487,"login":"dschmidt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODQ4Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commits/72a150293402023123117137228a0e8d11601917/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T11:23:58Z","email":"dev@dominik-schmidt.de","name":"Dominik Schmidt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T11:23:58Z","email":"dev@dominik-schmidt.de","name":"Dominik Schmidt"},"message":"docs: use OpenCloud''s ''app token'' terminology consistently\n\nOpenCloud calls these credentials ''app tokens'' (user settings → App\nTokens); ''app password'' was an internal misnomer from earlier drafts\nwhen the auth model still looked like per-app passwords. Rename\nacross code comments, docs, and the error message in the ''/rest''\nlegacy-auth rejection. No functional change.","tree":{"sha":"70b3bc4c6268d150396f51f22b13961a0087b62a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/git/trees/70b3bc4c6268d150396f51f22b13961a0087b62a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/git/commits/72a150293402023123117137228a0e8d11601917","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448487?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt","id":448487,"login":"dschmidt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODQ4Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commit/72a150293402023123117137228a0e8d11601917","node_id":"C_kwDOSIuvnNoAKDcyYTE1MDI5MzQwMjAyMzEyMzExNzEzNzIyOGEwZThkMTE2MDE5MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commit/991edc736eeeb49612cb4beaa110b78dcd8824aa","sha":"991edc736eeeb49612cb4beaa110b78dcd8824aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commits/991edc736eeeb49612cb4beaa110b78dcd8824aa"}],"sha":"72a150293402023123117137228a0e8d11601917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commits/72a150293402023123117137228a0e8d11601917"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448487?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dschmidt","id":448487,"login":"dschmidt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODQ4Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dschmidt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dschmidt/opencloud-music/commits/991edc736eeeb49612cb4beaa110b78dcd8824aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T11:21:40Z","email":"dev@dominik-schmidt.de","name":"Dominik Schmidt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T11:21:40Z","email":"dev@dominik-schmidt.de","name":"Dominik Schmidt"},"message":"chore: initial scaffolding\n\nOpenSubsonic-compatible music service for OpenCloud. Translates Subsonic\nAPI calls into OpenCloud Graph search + WebDAV streaming; no local DB,\nno CS3/Reva gateway, no OIDC exchange. Auth is HTTP Basic with an\nOpenCloud app password, forwarded verbatim to OpenCloud.\n\nBackend:\n- cmd/music + pkg/command + pkg/config, go-chi router\n- internal/subsonic: handlers for ping, getUser, tokenInfo,\n  getMusicFolders, getArtists, getArtist, getAlbum, getSong, getGenres,\n  getAlbumList2, getRandomSongs, getSongsByGenre, search3, stream;\n  star/scrobble/rating are stubbed no-ops, getCoverArt returns 404\n- internal/graph: thin Graph client using KQL + nested aggregations\n  (artist -> album -> sum(duration)) to avoid N+1 round-trips\n- internal/stream: WebDAV reverse-proxy with Range passthrough\n- Subsonic server stubs generated via go:generate from a pinned\n  OpenSubsonic OpenAPI commit; not committed\n\nFrontend:\n- Placeholder Vue 3 extension at /music showing connection hints\n- No real UI — Subsonic clients are the product surface\n\nInfra:\n- Multi-stage Dockerfile, docker-compose targeting an existing\n  OpenCloud on host.docker.internal:9200\n- CI workflow: frontend (lint/typecheck/test/build) + backend\n  (generate/test/lint) + docker-build + docker-push on main/tags\n- renovate.json5 with a customManager that keeps the pinned\n  OpenSubsonic spec SHA in sync with its main branch\n\nEnv vars follow Open