/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/bb07f2a7c96136056125bc35f844e0892ff659d5","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGJiMDdmMmE3Yzk2MTM2MDU2MTI1YmMzNWY4NDRlMDg5MmZmNjU5ZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/c24de3ed836e120f58392da786378a1c8436c200","sha":"c24de3ed836e120f58392da786378a1c8436c200","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/c24de3ed836e120f58392da786378a1c8436c200"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/fab904f32790f7e065cf737b38b20a63313e8de9","sha":"fab904f32790f7e065cf737b38b20a63313e8de9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/fab904f32790f7e065cf737b38b20a63313e8de9"}],"sha":"bb07f2a7c96136056125bc35f844e0892ff659d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/bb07f2a7c96136056125bc35f844e0892ff659d5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/fab904f32790f7e065cf737b38b20a63313e8de9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T02:45:13Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T02:45:13Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"♻️ refactor(native-patch): 精简 always-on 注入块，抽 source-truth-lint 共享 helper，补升级耦合审计清单\n\n借鉴 Superpowers 6.1.0「按 per-session token 成本精简、折叠冗余、保留高信号」的思路：\n\n- using-superpowers 注入块（唯一每 session 都付的块）外科精简 1097 → 958 chars（-13%），\n  只砍重述性措辞，保留全部 smoke 钉的语义串与行为防线。\n- executing-plans / SDD 两份近乎相同的 \"Source-of-Truth Task Lint\" 段（~680 chars、重叠 54%）\n  抽成 _source_truth_task_lint() 共享 helper，只留 6 个 framing 词做参数；渲染输出逐字节不变\n  （纯重构、防漂移，不改注入行为——两条路径每 session 只跑一条，本就不省 token）。\n- ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN.md 增「升级 Superpowers 后的耦合审计清单」：锚点 / prose 里叙述的\n  上游名字 / 引用的上游文件 / 验证 四类，把这次 6.1.0 断锚点的教训沉淀成 checklist。\n\n验证：渲染快照比对确认 exec/SDD 块逐字节不变、其余块不变、using-superpowers 保留全部 18 个\n钉串；真实 6.1.0 目标 install/verify/native-wiki-patch-smoke 全绿且重装幂等（already satisfied）。","tree":{"sha":"d3f2eac362980758035b4d994aeb701a0ce1f4d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/d3f2eac362980758035b4d994aeb701a0ce1f4d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/fab904f32790f7e065cf737b38b20a63313e8de9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/fab904f32790f7e065cf737b38b20a63313e8de9","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGZhYjkwNGYzMjc5MGY3ZTA2NWNmNzM3YjM4YjIwYTYzMzEzZThkZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/006a455962342d9f46a6cfb2b8d9c9fa0a229062","sha":"006a455962342d9f46a6cfb2b8d9c9fa0a229062","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/006a455962342d9f46a6cfb2b8d9c9fa0a229062"}],"sha":"fab904f32790f7e065cf737b38b20a63313e8de9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/fab904f32790f7e065cf737b38b20a63313e8de9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/006a455962342d9f46a6cfb2b8d9c9fa0a229062/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T02:07:02Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T02:07:02Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"🐛 fix(native-patch): 适配 Superpowers 6.1.0 锚点，修复 apply_patch 重装空行累积\n\nSuperpowers 6.1.0 压缩了 using-superpowers bootstrap，把独立的\n\"## Instruction Priority\" 段折叠进 \"## User Instructions\"，注入锚点消失，\n导致 native skill patch 在 6.1.0 上 install 硬失败（Missing anchor）。\n\n- native_skill_patch.py：using-superpowers 锚点改为 \"## User Instructions\"，\n  旧标题保留为 fallback_anchors，兼容 6.0.x（两个标题在 6.0.3 均存在）。\n- native_skill_patch.py：apply_patch 现为 strip_block 的精确逆操作（仅补一个\n  前导换行、不再多补尾随换行），重复安装字节稳定，redundant install 正确报告\n  \"already satisfied\"；修掉每次重装泄漏一个空行的既有缺陷。\n- manifest.json：adaptedSuperpowersVersion 6.0.0 → 6.1.0（minSuperpowersVersion 仍 6.0.0）。\n- README / ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN / ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN：适配基线文案同步到 6.1.0。\n\nchangelog 另一项（删除 claude-code-tools.md / copilot-tools.md）adapter 全仓零引用，无需改动。\n\n验证：干净 6.1.0 与 old-format 迁移均 install×3 字节稳定；对真实 6.1.0 目标\nmanage.sh install/verify、native-wiki-patch-smoke、version-gate、\ninstall-version-warning 全部通过。","tree":{"sha":"23ef3730c0d2a00a910158d08dd2279b3d4b5b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/23ef3730c0d2a00a910158d08dd2279b3d4b5b63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/006a455962342d9f46a6cfb2b8d9c9fa0a229062","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/006a455962342d9f46a6cfb2b8d9c9fa0a229062","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDAwNmE0NTU5NjIzNDJkOWY0NmE2Y2ZiMmI4ZDljOWZhMGEyMjkwNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/c24de3ed836e120f58392da786378a1c8436c200","sha":"c24de3ed836e120f58392da786378a1c8436c200","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/c24de3ed836e120f58392da786378a1c8436c200"}],"sha":"006a455962342d9f46a6cfb2b8d9c9fa0a229062","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/006a455962342d9f46a6cfb2b8d9c9fa0a229062"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/c24de3ed836e120f58392da786378a1c8436c200/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T13:34:29Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T13:34:29Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"♻️ refactor(prompts): 精简 adapter 注入提示词，update-wiki 判定句 4 副本合并为单一共享常量\n\n- native_skill_patch.py: update-wiki keep-or-skip 判定句（executing-plans/SDD/finishing + post-merge hook 共 4 份漂移副本）合并为单一 _UPDATE_WIKI_DETERMINATION 常量并删内部三重复述；preflight-fail / source-truth 孪生块抽成 helper；brainstorming sequence gate 收紧。\n- wiki-researcher.md −8.5%：删 researcher 从不执行的主-agent 脚本 recipe（保留 forbid-list）、github_mcp 8 步导航收为 4 步、discovery-card/documentContext 收紧。\n- Lanhu 集群（common.md / role-prd/{frontend,backend}.md / sync_role_prd.py / lanhu SKILL.md）：重复枚举改「说一次+引用」、checklist 收拢、删 render_format_contract 中与 common.md 重复的 bullet。\n- scaffold-practice-skill SKILL.md（−723B）与 post-merge hook reminder 收紧。\n- 只删重复不动硬约束：verify.sh 与 lanhu-*-smoke 按原文钉死的关键句全部保留，行为/用户流程零变化。\n- 验证：install / verify / native-patch smoke / hook smoke(12) / 8 lanhu smoke / release-check 全过。","tree":{"sha":"f1bfcd8a6e1b8bd1f11d70f24c22a71b13db0faa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/f1bfcd8a6e1b8bd1f11d70f24c22a71b13db0faa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/c24de3ed836e120f58392da786378a1c8436c200","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/c24de3ed836e120f58392da786378a1c8436c200","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGMyNGRlM2VkODM2ZTEyMGY1ODM5MmRhNzg2Mzc4YTFjODQzNmMyMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/9c60384fbe1ded056ae2c90b71b360d7e276dfd6","sha":"9c60384fbe1ded056ae2c90b71b360d7e276dfd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/9c60384fbe1ded056ae2c90b71b360d7e276dfd6"}],"sha":"c24de3ed836e120f58392da786378a1c8436c200","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/c24de3ed836e120f58392da786378a1c8436c200"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/9c60384fbe1ded056ae2c90b71b360d7e276dfd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T08:57:56Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T08:57:56Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(wiki-graph-ci): export-wiki-skills 默认钉版本图重建 Action，PR 合入后刷新 .graph.json\n\n消费者 PR（含 shared-wiki MCP PR 路径）只带得动逐页 companion *.index.md，\n跨页根 .graph.json（section 边 + backlinks，正是 MCP graph-neighbors / 执行期\ngithub_mcp 硬约束 1 跳 depends-on 闭包读的那份）进不了 patch，合入后会陈旧到\n维护者手动重建。\n\n新增 overlays/wiki-repo-ci/rebuild-wiki-graph.yml：export-wiki-skills 默认钉版本\n写入目标 wiki 仓库 .github/workflows/，push 到默认分支时复用同一份 vendored\nwiki_migrate_helper.py --generate-indexes 重建图并带 [skip ci] 回写（只在默认\n分支、no-diff 不提交，图生成器与维护者侧绝不分叉）。三重防回环：[skip ci] +\npaths 仅 **/*.md + if 仅默认分支。--no-graph-ci 跳过并移除自己钉的 marker 文件\n（手写同名 workflow 不动）。\n\n- lib/export_wiki_skills.py：默认 stamp workflow（marker 占位替换），纳入 marker\n  预检 + .export-manifest.json 哈希清单（新增 graphCi/workflows 字段）\n- export-wiki-skills.sh / manage.sh：透传 [--no-graph-ci]\n- tests/export-wiki-skills-smoke.sh：默认导出 / --no-graph-ci 移除 managed /\n  保留手写 workflow 三组断言（31 passed）\n- README / ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN / CLAUDE.md：同步入口与 overlays/wiki-repo-ci 说明","tree":{"sha":"4390577a0b8bee69b2f7886a4a926191263892db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/4390577a0b8bee69b2f7886a4a926191263892db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/9c60384fbe1ded056ae2c90b71b360d7e276dfd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/9c60384fbe1ded056ae2c90b71b360d7e276dfd6","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDljNjAzODRmYmUxZGVkMDU2YWUyYzkwYjcxYjM2MGQ3ZTI3NmRmZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/a0d00f498591dcb02358770b744b7ae3d4fb9f6a","sha":"a0d00f498591dcb02358770b744b7ae3d4fb9f6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/a0d00f498591dcb02358770b744b7ae3d4fb9f6a"}],"sha":"9c60384fbe1ded056ae2c90b71b360d7e276dfd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/9c60384fbe1ded056ae2c90b71b360d7e276dfd6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/a0d00f498591dcb02358770b744b7ae3d4fb9f6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T06:33:43Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T06:33:43Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(wiki-closure): depends-on 1 跳闭包覆盖 shared-root 硬约束\n\n执行期 depends-on 闭包原先只从 project-root 本地 section seed、只读 project\n.graph.json，shared-root（尤其 source: github_mcp）硬约束完全没有闭包。两侧补齐：\n\n- wiki_common.depends_on_closure_targets：单点纯函数，统一边筛选（只闭 depends-on、\n  只取 section 级目标、可选 indexed 门控），renderer 与 materializer 共用，永不分叉。\n- 渲染器 closure 一般化到本地 shared root：_load_local_section_graph 按 root 读各自\n  .graph.json，reread_entries 同时 seed project 与本地 shared 硬约束（--reread-list 忠实）。\n- github_mcp 闭包改由 materializer 经远端图完成：shared-wiki MCP 新增 graph-neighbors\n  CLI 子命令（复用 graphNeighborsTool，与 read-sections 对称），wiki_materialize_task.py\n  对选中 github_mcp 硬约束节点取 1 跳 depends-on indexed 目标，折进同一批 read-sections，\n  闭合而来的 section 标注来源节点；未 indexed 目标按门控跳过并计数。\n- fail-open：graph-neighbors 不可用（如旧 MCP 部署无此子命令）时闭包降级为空 + warning，\n  直接选中的硬约束仍走 strict read-sections fail-closed。\n\n测试：MCP vitest 69/69（含新增 graph-neighbors CLI 用例）；wiki-depends-on-closure-smoke\n新增 shared-local 用例；wiki-materialize-task-smoke 新增 closure/unindexed/fail-open 用例。","tree":{"sha":"1ac577d01c13fd7b32735e7e912266c217385103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/1ac577d01c13fd7b32735e7e912266c217385103"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/a0d00f498591dcb02358770b744b7ae3d4fb9f6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/a0d00f498591dcb02358770b744b7ae3d4fb9f6a","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGEwZDAwZjQ5ODU5MWRjYjAyMzU4NzcwYjc0NGI3YWUzZDRmYjlmNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/98e29f7ac5c8fb369311fba8a27db127d3a1777c","sha":"98e29f7ac5c8fb369311fba8a27db127d3a1777c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/98e29f7ac5c8fb369311fba8a27db127d3a1777c"}],"sha":"a0d00f498591dcb02358770b744b7ae3d4fb9f6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/a0d00f498591dcb02358770b744b7ae3d4fb9f6a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/98e29f7ac5c8fb369311fba8a27db127d3a1777c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T01:56:52Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T01:56:52Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"🐛 fix(source-truth): ! 否定行单列为 carve-out 组，不再误挂在规则 role 标题下\n\ninline `!` 否定本只在机械校验里生效（被抠路径归 unconfigured 不拦），\n但 render_prompt 把 `!` 行原样塞进规则自己的 role 组，提示词里 `!truth`\n路径被当作权威源列出，语义误导。\n\n- _group_policy_patterns 把 `!` 模式剥前缀分流进 carve_outs 组\n- 5 个 prompt kind 在 truth/evidence 组后追加渲染 carve-out（空组不渲染）\n- smoke 加 inline truth/never 否定用例 + 复用现有 !openapi/draft/** 断言\n- settings.example.jsonc 注明否定行的校验/渲染行为","tree":{"sha":"58ba77b42bf0aa366e2d61327747d842f827514c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/58ba77b42bf0aa366e2d61327747d842f827514c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/98e29f7ac5c8fb369311fba8a27db127d3a1777c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/98e29f7ac5c8fb369311fba8a27db127d3a1777c","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDk4ZTI5ZjdhYzVjOGZiMzY5MzExZmJhOGEyN2RiMTI3ZDNhMTc3N2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/5a609267f367fa42c9d28c971b423e2662253d30","sha":"5a609267f367fa42c9d28c971b423e2662253d30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/5a609267f367fa42c9d28c971b423e2662253d30"}],"sha":"98e29f7ac5c8fb369311fba8a27db127d3a1777c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/98e29f7ac5c8fb369311fba8a27db127d3a1777c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/5a609267f367fa42c9d28c971b423e2662253d30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T01:48:42Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T01:48:42Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(wiki-reread): 单一固定取数器 wiki_materialize_task.py 取本地+github_mcp 硬约束 reread，shared-wiki MCP 加 read-sections CLI\n\n执行期硬约束 reread 从「主 agent 手动跑 --reread-list → 按 source 分叉两种抓取 → 追加到 task wiki 文件」的自觉式三步连招，塌缩为单条命令，消除被执行期吞掉的 salience 缺口。\n\n- mcp/shared-wiki 新增 read-sections CLI（src/cli.ts + index.ts 子命令派发），复用 server 同一 loadConfig + readSectionsTool + withCloneLock，是全系统唯一 shared-wiki 读取实现（不在 python 侧重新 clone）；输出 batch 结果 + 顶层 repoUrl 供漂移检测\n- overlays/scripts/wiki_materialize_task.py：列 task-scoped reread（复用从 render_reread_list 抽出的 reread_entries，选集不分叉）、本地 section 直抽、source: github_mcp 经 CLI（命令从 --shared-wiki-cmd / SHARED_WIKI_MCP_CMD / 项目 MCP 注册解析），换绑/revision 漂移、section 错误、partial 结果一律 fail-closed，绝不静默丢硬约束\n- native patch（executing-plans / subagent-driven-development）改调单命令；manifest.json / install.sh / verify.sh / self-test.sh / native-wiki-patch-smoke.sh 同步登记；新增 wiki-materialize-task-smoke.sh + cli.test.ts\n- 文档（CLAUDE.md / ADAPTER_USER_FLOW / ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT / ADAPTER_INTEGRATION / README / mcp README）同步执行期 reread 机制","tree":{"sha":"c81ee6420291498b25452d623256c8b4da57a731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/c81ee6420291498b25452d623256c8b4da57a731"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/5a609267f367fa42c9d28c971b423e2662253d30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/5a609267f367fa42c9d28c971b423e2662253d30","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDVhNjA5MjY3ZjM2N2ZhNDJjOWQyOGM5NzFiNDIzZTI2NjIyNTNkMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/472342dd0fc410af577d895cdbc3c8c0e38efe59","sha":"472342dd0fc410af577d895cdbc3c8c0e38efe59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/472342dd0fc410af577d895cdbc3c8c0e38efe59"}],"sha":"5a609267f367fa42c9d28c971b423e2662253d30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/5a609267f367fa42c9d28c971b423e2662253d30"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/472342dd0fc410af577d895cdbc3c8c0e38efe59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:50:15Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:50:15Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"⚡️ perf(wiki-context): R6 source-anchor excerpt render 软上限 + R7 brainstorming Lanhu prose 压缩，收尾上下文优化 backlog\n\nbacklog 最后两项（均已批准方向）：\n\nR6 — source-anchor 软上限：_append_source_anchors 经新 _truncate_excerpt 把 excerpt 在 render 处软上限 200 字符（MAX_SOURCE_ANCHOR_EXCERPT）+ 省略号 hint。非破坏：anchor 是 pointer 不是权威文本（reread 才是），只截执行注入这一处，不动 stored selection。researcher 契约同步软建议「短 pointer ≤200 字符，reread 带全文」；json-render-smoke 加 import 式 cap 单测。\n\nR7 — Lanhu prose 压缩：brainstorming 注入块 Lanhu 段 9 行（含独立代码块）压成 1 段（-8 行），保留 native-wiki-patch-smoke 钉的全部 6 个边界串（inline 命令 / 不在 brainstorming 跑 Lanhu / 确认 .lanhu/.../index.md 包 / 先读 index.md / 不默认调 MCP / MCP 可选）+ evidence 边界句（Lanhu 只作 Superpowers 输入，不进 acceptance/test/solution/tasks）。\n\n至此上下文优化 backlog R 项全部落地（R1/R3/R4/R5/R6/R7/R8；R2 误判勿提）。\n验收：install/verify/native-wiki-patch-smoke/wiki-context-json-render-smoke/release-check 全绿。","tree":{"sha":"243e513d7fe392b0fe4c2e45e2419af6eb011485","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/243e513d7fe392b0fe4c2e45e2419af6eb011485"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/472342dd0fc410af577d895cdbc3c8c0e38efe59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/472342dd0fc410af577d895cdbc3c8c0e38efe59","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDQ3MjM0MmRkMGZjNDEwYWY1NzdkODk1Y2RiYzNjOGMwZTM4ZWZlNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/200d368d211c368a070865f275c5611ed3d75673","sha":"200d368d211c368a070865f275c5611ed3d75673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/200d368d211c368a070865f275c5611ed3d75673"}],"sha":"472342dd0fc410af577d895cdbc3c8c0e38efe59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/472342dd0fc410af577d895cdbc3c8c0e38efe59"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/200d368d211c368a070865f275c5611ed3d75673/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:33:36Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:33:36Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"⚡️ perf(wiki-context): 执行渲染裁规划记账位 + scaffold 缩 sidecar(删 section_name/空桶)，削减每 task 渲染回灌\n\nR5（上下文优化 backlog）。先查实：约束分桶 role 过滤 + 空桶跳过早在 34a7b70 已做（implementer 本就不见 review 桶），本次落地剩余两项——\n\n- 执行渲染裁字段：render_markdown 删 relevance/confidence/destination(+reason) 规划/路由记账位（执行不消费：section 能渲染就说明已路由到本 task），_append_reread 删冗余 section_name 行。保留 relevanceTo + reason（分开不合并）、hard constraint、约束、reread、anchors。每 section 省约 5 行，在 N section×M task×2 role 上乘性。\n- scaffold 缩 sidecar：_scaffold_section 不再写 section_name（sectionId 唯一权威）和空 constraint 桶（_as_list(None)→[] 下游安全，render/validate 都容缺类别）。主 agent 读的 sidecar 更小。\n\n向后兼容：render/validate 仍接受 sectionId-or-section_name 与缺类别（旧/手写 sidecar 不破）。\n\n测试/文档：scaffold-smoke:225 断言改为只剩非空类别 + 验 section_name 已删；wiki-context-v4.example.jsonc 删 section_name×3、deep-path 演示空桶省略；ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN 同步。\n验收：install/verify/native-wiki-patch-smoke/wiki-context-scaffold-smoke/wiki-context-json-render-smoke/release-check 全绿。","tree":{"sha":"c02108fcbd9c175e980d03750f9f249fc6a3112d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/c02108fcbd9c175e980d03750f9f249fc6a3112d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/200d368d211c368a070865f275c5611ed3d75673","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/200d368d211c368a070865f275c5611ed3d75673","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDIwMGQzNjhkMjExYzM2OGEwNzA4NjVmMjc1YzU2MTFlZDNkNzU2NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/7ca44f96dc39acf32c3021fb44e0b0041abbb833","sha":"7ca44f96dc39acf32c3021fb44e0b0041abbb833","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/7ca44f96dc39acf32c3021fb44e0b0041abbb833"}],"sha":"200d368d211c368a070865f275c5611ed3d75673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/200d368d211c368a070865f275c5611ed3d75673"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/7ca44f96dc39acf32c3021fb44e0b0041abbb833/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T13:38:05Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T13:38:05Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(wiki-context): --finalize 合并 scaffold-tasks+bind 单写 + researcher plan 阶段自写 selection 只回摘要，削减 planning 主上下文回灌\n\n针对 planning 阶段两类「流程性」主上下文回灌做优化（源于一张 /btw 主 session 占用分析）：被 Read 追踪的 sidecar 多次原地改写各触发一次全文回灌，以及 wiki-researcher 整份 selection JSON 往返主上下文。\n\nTier 1''（--finalize 单写）：\n- wiki_context_render.py 新增 --finalize：一步做 scaffold-tasks(roster) + bind(fingerprint) + execution-ready 校验 + 单次写盘，事务式（整体成或败）。守卫禁止与 --scaffold/--scaffold-tasks/--bind-fingerprints 混用。\n- writing-plans 注入改序：原「--scaffold-tasks → 编辑 destination → --bind-fingerprints」三步收成「稳定后单次 destination 编辑 → --finalize」，并删掉 scaffold 后那次冗余的早期 reason/kind 编辑。sidecar 原地改写从 2 次降到 1 次，少一次全文回灌；注入加「脚本跑完别回读 sidecar」。\n- --scaffold-tasks/--bind-fingerprints 保留为独立子命令，供执行期换绑漂移 re-stamp。\n- verify.sh 的 writing-plans required string 由 --bind-fingerprints 改为 --finalize。\n\nTier 2（researcher 自写 selection）：\n- wiki-researcher 在 phase: plan 自己把 selection 写入 selectionOutputPath（新输入字段），只回紧凑摘要（选中页+计数+caveats），不再整份回灌让主 agent verbatim 存。与 source-of-truth-verifier 同款模式（子代理写大产物、回 envelope）。\n- brainstorm/debug/implement/review 仍 inline 返回 selection、不写文件；plan 无 wiki 时不写、回 status N/A；写不了时回退 inline，主 agent 据摘要 status 分支处理。\n- 这是对 wiki-researcher「全历史版本只读」不变量的有意窄例外（仅这一个即用即删的 transient 文件）；7071afe「只剩 plan+.wiki-context.json」意图不变（--scaffold 仍 consume-and-remove）。\n\n测试/文档：\n- wiki-context-scaffold-smoke 加 --finalize 全链 + 幂等 + 两负例；native-wiki-patch-smoke 加 selectionOutputPath/Plan-phase return 断言。\n- README / ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN / ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN 同步 planning 流程；wiki-selection 契约注释更新。\n\n验收：install/verify/native-wiki-patch-smoke/wiki-context-scaffold-smoke/wiki-context-json-render-smoke/release-check 全绿。仍欠 Claude Code 真实 planning 路径验收（researcher 真能 Write selectionOutputPath、--finalize 单写、主 agent 只收摘要）。","tree":{"sha":"732fb05ba030f117f61b760edf272e792635d81b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/732fb05ba030f117f61b760edf272e792635d81b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/7ca44f96dc39acf32c3021fb44e0b0041abbb833","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/7ca44f96dc39acf32c3021fb44e0b0041abbb833","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDdjYTQ0Zjk2ZGMzOWFjZjMyYzMwMjFmYjQ0ZTBiMDA0MWFiYmI4MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/e4c6ea17715bf0c04ba235783f0aac94925ac6b3","sha":"e4c6ea17715bf0c04ba235783f0aac94925ac6b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e4c6ea17715bf0c04ba235783f0aac94925ac6b3"}],"sha":"7ca44f96dc39acf32c3021fb44e0b0041abbb833","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/7ca44f96dc39acf32c3021fb44e0b0041abbb833"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e4c6ea17715bf0c04ba235783f0aac94925ac6b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T10:06:41Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T10:06:41Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(native-skill-patch): finishing 入口加 durable-knowledge gate，主闸口去留判定收紧为必须实跑 update-wiki\n\n修复主 agent 在执行末尾内联预判「无 durable knowledge」就直接进 finishing、\n绕过 update-wiki skill 的偏差。形成三层去留判定保障，三层都要求结论由实跑\nskill 得出，「跳过」必须是 skill 自己带理由的结论：\n\n- 执行/SDD 主闸口（executing-plans / subagent-driven-development）：软措辞\n  \"should use ... to decide\" 提升为 \"must run ... to make the keep-or-skip\n  determination\"，新增 \"candidate absence is not conclusive\"（空/缺 sidecar、\n  subagent 未报候选不构成结论依据，skill 还会权衡已实现改动与对话上下文）与\n  \"do not pre-decide ... and bypass the skill\"。\n- finishing-a-development-branch：新增 PatchSpec，在 ## The Process 顶部、\n  Step 1 之前注入 gate；块首 lead 原生前置（Step 1 验证测试不被替代/抢先），\n  点明 Option 1/4 在 Step 6 删 worktree 连带删 sidecar，是最后可靠消费点。\n\n配套：verify.sh 旧守卫（断言 finishing 不被 patch）改为 using-git-worktrees\n仍不 patch + finishing 必须带 gate，并给执行/SDD 校验加新文案断言；smoke 测试\n同步；manifest.json 把 finishing 加入 optionalPatchedPaths；README /\nUSER_FLOW / DEVELOPMENT 文档更新（含修正仍描述已移除 worktree-origin-metadata\n机制的 stale 文案）。\n\n验证：install/verify 全绿，native patch smoke 通过，uninstall→install→verify\n往返干净，安装文件确认 gate 落在 ## The Process 与 ### Step 1 之间。","tree":{"sha":"1ef55a274a9d769859c9549d57c739a157a9ec84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/1ef55a274a9d769859c9549d57c739a157a9ec84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/e4c6ea17715bf0c04ba235783f0aac94925ac6b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/e4c6ea17715bf0c04ba235783f0aac94925ac6b3","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGU0YzZlYTE3NzE1YmYwYzA0YmEyMzU3ODNmMGFhYzk0OTI1YWM2YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/5c6d2644baa079a852ed05bde37804cf0f090c19","sha":"5c6d2644baa079a852ed05bde37804cf0f090c19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/5c6d2644baa079a852ed05bde37804cf0f090c19"}],"sha":"e4c6ea17715bf0c04ba235783f0aac94925ac6b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e4c6ea17715bf0c04ba235783f0aac94925ac6b3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/5c6d2644baa079a852ed05bde37804cf0f090c19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T07:33:03Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T07:33:03Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"🐛 fix(native-skill-patch): update-wiki 在 worktree 清理前消费 candidates，post-merge 仅作 backstop\n\nexecution/SDD 末段明确：在移交 finishing-a-development-branch 或清理/退出\nworktree 之前，就在仍存活的 worktree 内调用 update-wiki 消费 worktree-local\n的 .wiki-candidates.jsonl，不要推迟到 post-merge 提醒（否则 sidecar 随 worktree\n删除而丢失）。\n\npost-merge hook 文案补两句：已为同一批工作跑过 update-wiki 时确认即可、无需重跑\n（避免冗余二次执行）；sidecar 已随清理消失时不据此认定无候选，改从已合并 diff +\n上下文判定。同步 ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN.md 的 hook 段落。","tree":{"sha":"a7837fd33833b374df9bc3d4dce72269be70ab90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/a7837fd33833b374df9bc3d4dce72269be70ab90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/5c6d2644baa079a852ed05bde37804cf0f090c19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/5c6d2644baa079a852ed05bde37804cf0f090c19","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDVjNmQyNjQ0YmFhMDc5YTg1MmVkMDViZGUzNzgwNGNmMGYwOTBjMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/341290943a7001cd138e36eec4722d9a76dd361a","sha":"341290943a7001cd138e36eec4722d9a76dd361a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/341290943a7001cd138e36eec4722d9a76dd361a"}],"sha":"5c6d2644baa079a852ed05bde37804cf0f090c19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/5c6d2644baa079a852ed05bde37804cf0f090c19"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/341290943a7001cd138e36eec4722d9a76dd361a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T03:37:05Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T03:37:05Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"🐛 fix(native-skill-patch): brainstorming 注入块顶部加 wiki-researcher 顺序闸\n\n现有块把 wiki-researcher 触发埋成 Lanhu/source-of-truth 之后的第三项软提示，\n实跑中模型沉入代码探索后会直接提方案、漏掉这一步。比照 SDD/executing-plans\n的 worktree-first 前置闸，把 wiki-researcher 段上移到块顶并加一行顺序闸：\n固定 探索→wiki-researcher(phase: brainstorm)→提方案 次序，明确不前置、\n不替换 native 探索步骤，并把检查点绑在提方案边界。非阻塞 N/A、不落盘语义\n与 smoke 断言字符串均保留。","tree":{"sha":"bba515fc56c0110ac3bf6a29f343295ef36ecb3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/bba515fc56c0110ac3bf6a29f343295ef36ecb3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/341290943a7001cd138e36eec4722d9a76dd361a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/341290943a7001cd138e36eec4722d9a76dd361a","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDM0MTI5MDk0M2E3MDAxY2QxMzhlMzZlZWM0NzIyZDlhNzZkZDM2MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/d268324ac4cd83d142d19ead1348a64e33fda178","sha":"d268324ac4cd83d142d19ead1348a64e33fda178","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/d268324ac4cd83d142d19ead1348a64e33fda178"}],"sha":"341290943a7001cd138e36eec4722d9a76dd361a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/341290943a7001cd138e36eec4722d9a76dd361a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/d268324ac4cd83d142d19ead1348a64e33fda178/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:06:19Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:06:19Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"🐛 fix(native-skill-patch): SDD/executing-plans 注入块顶部加 worktree-first 前置闸\n\nadapter 把 Task Context 块插在 native The Process/Step 2 顶部，占据模型“第一眼”\n位置，导致 worktree（只在底部 Integration 脚注）被挤出 preflight 心智模型而漏建。\n现在两条块都以加粗 worktree-first guard 开头：在 fingerprint preflight 之前先确认\nusing-git-worktrees 已建/验隔离 worktree，点破“在特性分支≠隔离 worktree”（Step 0 按\nGIT_DIR != GIT_COMMON 判定），并说明 ledger / $SDD_DIR 渲染文件 / task-brief 等都靠\ngit rev-parse --show-toplevel 解析、必须在最终 worktree 内运行。\n\nsmoke 加回归断言（Worktree first / superpowers:using-git-worktrees /\nGIT_DIR != GIT_COMMON）钉住 guard。install / verify / native-wiki-patch-smoke 均通过。","tree":{"sha":"c12faf64186e57e9459368d3689d559ff095d31c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/c12faf64186e57e9459368d3689d559ff095d31c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/d268324ac4cd83d142d19ead1348a64e33fda178","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/d268324ac4cd83d142d19ead1348a64e33fda178","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGQyNjgzMjRhYzRjZDgzZDE0MmQxOWVhZDEzNDhhNjRlMzNmZGExNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/18977d180feece79581ab62bc37e2ee4565f6499","sha":"18977d180feece79581ab62bc37e2ee4565f6499","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/18977d180feece79581ab62bc37e2ee4565f6499"}],"sha":"d268324ac4cd83d142d19ead1348a64e33fda178","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/d268324ac4cd83d142d19ead1348a64e33fda178"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/18977d180feece79581ab62bc37e2ee4565f6499/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T09:43:24Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T09:43:24Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(post-merge-update-wiki): 收紧提醒文案，要求实跑 update-wiki 做去留判定\n\n把 hook 提醒从「use update-wiki 审查」改为强制运行该 skill 完成\nkeep-or-skip 判定，禁止 Claude 自行预判「无 durable 知识」而绕过 skill；\nskip 仍合法，但必须是 skill 自身结论并附明确理由。","tree":{"sha":"c858760aeae6c8f6b21f6966ff02bec409328d43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/c858760aeae6c8f6b21f6966ff02bec409328d43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/r