36b668d26"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/ca414614bb2b4942338b284b105ff6cbc8ccc79b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T15:18:43Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T15:18:43Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(wiki): 轴 B — typed 节点(constraint/domain/decision/guide)\n\n把 wiki 从\"纯编码约束\"扩成涵盖领域知识与重大决策的项目记忆层。\n- 叶子页 frontmatter 声明 `type:`(默认 constraint);wiki_section.page_type/extract_page_frontmatter 解析\n- .graph.json 升 section-graph/3,带 pageTypes;.index.md 头部加 `> Type:`(blockquote 元数据,\n  extract_document_context 跳过它以免污染 overview)\n- wiki_update_check 报未知 page type 警告(非 dangling)\n- wiki-researcher 类型感知:按任务类型聚焦(实现/调试先 constraint/domain,规划/评审加 decision/guide),\n  不淹没编码任务;仅作选择判断,不改输出 schema\n- update-wiki:纳入闸加 domain knowledge;建新页设对应 type;decision 页用 ADR 模板 + supersedes/contradicts,\n  domain 页存稳定领域事实(SKILL.md / targeting.md / content-templates.md)\n- 执行期 0 跳不变(type 仅元数据);新增并注册 tests/wiki-page-type-smoke.sh;\n  wiki-section-graph-smoke schema 断言升 /3;同步 README / USER_FLOW / DEVELOPMENT","tree":{"sha":"122656e5f9dc47e5cdb4bd7be8950eb258985438","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/122656e5f9dc47e5cdb4bd7be8950eb258985438"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/ca414614bb2b4942338b284b105ff6cbc8ccc79b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/ca414614bb2b4942338b284b105ff6cbc8ccc79b","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGNhNDE0NjE0YmIyYjQ5NDIzMzhiMjg0YjEwNWZmNmNiYzhjY2M3OWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/c15e1f9a2405dc3334ecbe6d1216b20658f36be0","sha":"c15e1f9a2405dc3334ecbe6d1216b20658f36be0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/c15e1f9a2405dc3334ecbe6d1216b20658f36be0"}],"sha":"ca414614bb2b4942338b284b105ff6cbc8ccc79b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/ca414614bb2b4942338b284b105ff6cbc8ccc79b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/c15e1f9a2405dc3334ecbe6d1216b20658f36be0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T14:53:22Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T14:53:22Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(wiki): P4 — wiki-researcher 1 跳邻居发现(仅发现)\n\n选出候选 section 后做一次有界 1 跳邻居扫描(读 .graph.json edges/backlinks 或 .index.md\n引用/被引用列),把相关 section 作为额外候选提升 planning recall:\n- 仅发现:邻居按普通候选评估相关性并分类(direct/supporting/rejected),人/plan 仍显式选\n- 有界:只扩原候选的 1 跳,不递归;邻居须有 companion <stem>.index.md 才可选\n- 边类型作提示:depends-on 偏 direct/supporting;see-also 弱;supersedes/contradicts 暴露\n  可能过期但不自裁\n- 不改执行:depends-on 目标已由 P3b 执行期 1 跳闭包,无需仅为可用性而选\n同步 README。","tree":{"sha":"c52139c46cd7a60b622a22df724df7749bcaa16c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/c52139c46cd7a60b622a22df724df7749bcaa16c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/c15e1f9a2405dc3334ecbe6d1216b20658f36be0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/c15e1f9a2405dc3334ecbe6d1216b20658f36be0","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGMxNWUxZjlhMjQwNWRjMzMzNGVjYmU2ZDEyMTZiMjA2NThmMzZiZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/9513b7d974982197a6337fa864cf07ce871ebe05","sha":"9513b7d974982197a6337fa864cf07ce871ebe05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/9513b7d974982197a6337fa864cf07ce871ebe05"}],"sha":"c15e1f9a2405dc3334ecbe6d1216b20658f36be0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/c15e1f9a2405dc3334ecbe6d1216b20658f36be0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/9513b7d974982197a6337fa864cf07ce871ebe05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T14:50:27Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T14:50:27Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(wiki): P3b — depends-on 承重边选取期 1 跳闭包\n\nhard-constraint section 的 depends-on 边在 wiki_context_render.py --reread-list 渲染时\n1 跳闭包:目标 section 合成进 reread 集合,执行期一并回读,补上\"承重约束被链接挡住\"的缺口。\n- 纯加性、读 project .graph.json;缺图/非 project 根静默 no-op(向后兼容,不改 sidecar schema、\n  不碰 scaffold/fingerprint 校验路径)\n- 有界:不传递追目标自身的 depends-on;按 (root,localPath,sectionId) 去重;仅 section 级目标\n- see-also/supersedes/contradicts 执行期一律不追(负向测试覆盖)\n- 合成项带 source/root/localPath/sectionId,兼容 wiki_read_section --batch-jsonl 消费;\n  端到端管线测试确认目标 section 文本被注入\n- 新增并注册 tests/wiki-depends-on-closure-smoke.sh;同步 graph-maintenance.md / README /\n  ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN / ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN(执行期追链口径:只 depends-on、1 跳、有界)","tree":{"sha":"2a2d1f3137570883a278df97ecdef72f319c3c1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/2a2d1f3137570883a278df97ecdef72f319c3c1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/9513b7d974982197a6337fa864cf07ce871ebe05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/9513b7d974982197a6337fa864cf07ce871ebe05","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDk1MTNiN2Q5NzQ5ODIxOTdhNjMzN2ZhODY0Y2YwN2NlODcxZWJlMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/14dfc907ef011a42e9f64036109e631cc357f5fa","sha":"14dfc907ef011a42e9f64036109e631cc357f5fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/14dfc907ef011a42e9f64036109e631cc357f5fa"}],"sha":"9513b7d974982197a6337fa864cf07ce871ebe05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/9513b7d974982197a6337fa864cf07ce871ebe05"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/14dfc907ef011a42e9f64036109e631cc357f5fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T14:26:04Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T14:26:04Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(wiki): typed section 边 (see-also/depends-on/supersedes/contradicts) + 矛盾/取代处理\n\nP3a —— 给 [[ ]] 边加类型,纯 wiki 层 + 维护,不碰消费层(执行仍 0 跳):\n- 语法 [[type: page#section]](冒号后需空格,以和 http:// 及裸路径消歧);\n  裸 [[ ]] 默认 see-also;未知前缀(如 depend-on 拼错)被 lint 报 unknown edge type\n- .graph.json 升 section-graph/2:edges 带 type,backlinks 带 {from,type}\n- .index.md 引用/被引用列对非 see-also 边标注类型\n- graph-maintenance.md companion:4 类型说明 + 矛盾(contradicts,不静默覆盖、双记+日期+待裁决)\n  与取代(supersedes,提示旧 section 的 backlinks 可能要重指)处理流程\n- 同步 README / ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN;扩展 wiki-section-graph-smoke 覆盖 typed/unknown/外链消歧\n\n不变式守住:depends-on 目标在执行期仍不自动追链(选取期闭包是 P3b);schemaVersion 4 不动。","tree":{"sha":"2378e6813f6cd45c01f7896d2fa37b8a35589a20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/2378e6813f6cd45c01f7896d2fa37b8a35589a20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/14dfc907ef011a42e9f64036109e631cc357f5fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/14dfc907ef011a42e9f64036109e631cc357f5fa","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDE0ZGZjOTA3ZWYwMTFhNDJlOWY2NDAzNjEwOWU2MzFjYzM1N2Y1ZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/956c1225f9e0171e32ebc443386e5cf687aa0f3f","sha":"956c1225f9e0171e32ebc443386e5cf687aa0f3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/956c1225f9e0171e32ebc443386e5cf687aa0f3f"}],"sha":"14dfc907ef011a42e9f64036109e631cc357f5fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/14dfc907ef011a42e9f64036109e631cc357f5fa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/956c1225f9e0171e32ebc443386e5cf687aa0f3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T13:58:03Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T13:58:03Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(wiki): section 级 [[page#section]] 引用 + update-wiki 瘦身为分层 skill 包\n\nP1 图构建(纯派生,不改消费):\n- wiki_section.extract_section_links 解析 [[page#section]],归属最内层 section,\n  跳过 fenced/inline code;只认 [[ ]],散链 (path#anchor) 不算\n- wiki_common.build_section_graph 产 节点/边/backlinks/dangling;不改\n  build_wiki_index_graph(仍页粒度、仍 strip #),section 图另起新函数\n- wiki_generate_section_index 每 wiki root 写 .graph.json(单文件模式也重建),\n  .index.md 增「引用/被引用」两列\n\nP2 lint:\n- wiki_update_check 报悬空 [[ ]] 边为 warning(与悬空页引用一致,不阻断既有 wiki),\n  自动流入 doctor/release-check\n\nupdate-wiki 瘦身(454→166 行薄 router + 按需 companion):\n- references/{targeting,content-templates,shared-wiki,graph-maintenance}.md\n- graph-maintenance.md 含 [[ ]] 边规则 + backlink 感知编辑;图机械部分下沉脚本层\n- 常见「无 durable knowledge → 跳过」路径只载 router\n\n配套:manifest 登记 4 个 companion;verify.sh 卫生检查扩到 skills/*/references/*.md;\n新增并注册 tests/wiki-section-graph-smoke.sh;native-wiki-patch-smoke guardrail 改查整个 skill 包;\n同步 README / ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN / ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN。\n\n不变式:执行期 0 跳(图只供维护+lint),wiki-context schemaVersion 4 不动,markdown 唯一真相源,不引外部图谱工具。\nP3(typed 边/选取期闭包)、P4(researcher 1 跳)待办。","tree":{"sha":"0ecf664d9ff28a516ef689180cb0012a442db504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/0ecf664d9ff28a516ef689180cb0012a442db504"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/956c1225f9e0171e32ebc443386e5cf687aa0f3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/956c1225f9e0171e32ebc443386e5cf687aa0f3f","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDk1NmMxMjI1ZjllMDE3MWUzMmViYzQ0MzM4NmU1Y2Y2ODdhYTBmM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/6c71796efad0f7b30b89ca1b1f2dc7199f4501c5","sha":"6c71796efad0f7b30b89ca1b1f2dc7199f4501c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/6c71796efad0f7b30b89ca1b1f2dc7199f4501c5"}],"sha":"956c1225f9e0171e32ebc443386e5cf687aa0f3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/956c1225f9e0171e32ebc443386e5cf687aa0f3f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/6c71796efad0f7b30b89ca1b1f2dc7199f4501c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T00:24:34Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T00:24:34Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"♻️ refactor(wiki-context): collapse routing to section.destination (schemaVersion 4)\n\nThe planning agent kept looping while hand-writing the globalWikiRefs /\ntaskWikiRefs[].wikiRefs collections (missing reason, flat vs nested sectionRef,\nlocalPath/wikiPath). Those collections duplicated each section''s identity plus a\nthird reason, and routing was already on section.destination.kind.\n\nschemaVersion 4 moves ALL routing onto each section''s destination:\n- global        -> every task and reviewer (no tasks)\n- task-bound    -> only the plan task ids in destination.tasks (scaffold seeds [])\n- planning-only -> not injected at execution\n\nRemoves globalWikiRefs, per-task wikiRefs, sectionRef, and legacy appliesTo.\ntaskWikiRefs is now only the task roster + taskFingerprint anchor; the renderer\nderives each task''s wiki scope straight from destination. The author edits values\nin the already-shaped skeleton (kind/reason/tasks) instead of inventing nested refs.\n\n- wiki_context_render.py: validate/render/scaffold/bind read routing from\n  destination; delete ref helpers; strict-reject appliesTo with a migration hint\n- native_skill_patch.py + wiki-researcher.md: author edits destination(+tasks)\n- contracts: rename wiki-context-v3.example.jsonc -> v4 (+ removedPaths prune)\n- tests: scaffold/render/native-patch smokes; verify.sh token asserts\n- docs: README, ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN, ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN, ADAPTER_INTEGRATION_CN\n\nVerified: both wiki-context smokes, install, verify, and a full release-check\n(verify + doctor + self-test battery + export-manifest) on a fresh temp project.","tree":{"sha":"9c90ad069c9b41182d24daceaba37de2d9c0fc8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/9c90ad069c9b41182d24daceaba37de2d9c0fc8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/6c71796efad0f7b30b89ca1b1f2dc7199f4501c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/6c71796efad0f7b30b89ca1b1f2dc7199f4501c5","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDZjNzE3OTZlZmFkMGY3YjMwYjg5Y2ExYjFmMmRjNzE5OWY0NTAxYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/975c52ecf02b83e1c87cd76944b860116625b35f","sha":"975c52ecf02b83e1c87cd76944b860116625b35f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/975c52ecf02b83e1c87cd76944b860116625b35f"}],"sha":"6c71796efad0f7b30b89ca1b1f2dc7199f4501c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/6c71796efad0f7b30b89ca1b1f2dc7199f4501c5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/975c52ecf02b83e1c87cd76944b860116625b35f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T07:20:34Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T07:20:34Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"fix: prevent nested SDD subagent dispatch","tree":{"sha":"f43a29b1d95a3e677ec464b75cf4f660a69e5d99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/f43a29b1d95a3e677ec464b75cf4f660a69e5d99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/975c52ecf02b83e1c87cd76944b860116625b35f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/975c52ecf02b83e1c87cd76944b860116625b35f","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDk3NWM1MmVjZjAyYjgzZTFjODdjZDc2OTQ0Yjg2MDExNjYyNWIzNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/265ee4a0ce69009d18ee4a9c9fbdcab3f4aaec48","sha":"265ee4a0ce69009d18ee4a9c9fbdcab3f4aaec48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/265ee4a0ce69009d18ee4a9c9fbdcab3f4aaec48"}],"sha":"975c52ecf02b83e1c87cd76944b860116625b35f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/975c52ecf02b83e1c87cd76944b860116625b35f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/265ee4a0ce69009d18ee4a9c9fbdcab3f4aaec48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T15:22:16Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T15:22:16Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(scaffold-practice-skill): layered best-practice skill packs + wiki discovery cards\n\nCapture reusable engineering practices as layered skill packs under\n.claude/skills/<name>/ (a thin SKILL.md router + on-demand files), or convert\nexisting monolithic skills into that shape non-destructively, and register a\ndiscovery card in guides/skills.md so wiki-researcher can bind \"use skill X\"\nduring planning. The wiki points at the skill; the skill never hard-codes wiki\npaths. Only SKILL.md is fixed — everything else is an open set — for progressive\ndisclosure while keeping the skill complete and usable outside Superpowers.\n\n- scripts/scaffold_practice_skill.py: mechanical scaffold/convert/register-card/\n  validate; open file set, non-destructive convert (carries bundled files incl.\n  scripts/, reports source coverage gaps), companion-index regen + index linkage,\n  honors wiki.updateAuthorization (refuse not bypassable), idempotent\n- skills/scaffold-practice-skill/SKILL.md: agent-led create/convert entry\n- skills/update-wiki: route reusable workflow/process knowledge to a skill pack\n  instead of writing it as a wiki leaf page (routes only, does not create skills)\n- wiki-template/standard: ship guides/skills.md catalog + register in guides/index.md\n- tests: scaffold-practice-skill-smoke.sh (23 assertions) + bootstrap import\n  assertion, both wired into self-test/release-check\n- docs: README, QUICKSTART_CN, ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN, ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN, CLAUDE","tree":{"sha":"ec47de0e969b65a78b6f856a40449f922d14932f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/ec47de0e969b65a78b6f856a40449f922d14932f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/265ee4a0ce69009d18ee4a9c9fbdcab3f4aaec48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/265ee4a0ce69009d18ee4a9c9fbdcab3f4aaec48","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDI2NWVlNGEwY2U2OTAwOWQxOGVlNGE5YzlmYmRjYWIzZjRhYWVjNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/7071afe2bb6dfece5b9c5ac20c0c151e095c33f7","sha":"7071afe2bb6dfece5b9c5ac20c0c151e095c33f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/7071afe2bb6dfece5b9c5ac20c0c151e095c33f7"}],"sha":"265ee4a0ce69009d18ee4a9c9fbdcab3f4aaec48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/265ee4a0ce69009d18ee4a9c9fbdcab3f4aaec48"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/7071afe2bb6dfece5b9c5ac20c0c151e095c33f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T13:28:28Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T13:28:28Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(wiki-context): consume-and-remove .wiki-selection.json on scaffold\n\nThe wiki-researcher selection is a planning-time intermediate: --scaffold reads\nit to generate the deep .wiki-context.json, and nothing afterward (execution,\nSDD, fingerprint preflight) ever reads it again. It was created but never\ncleaned up or classified — unlike .wiki-candidates.jsonl — so a finished plan\nleft a stray .wiki-selection.json beside .md + .wiki-context.json.\n\n- wiki_context_render.py --scaffold now removes the selection it consumed on\n  success, so only the plan and its .wiki-context.json persist. A structural\n  error raises before the write, so a failed scaffold keeps the selection for\n  repair. New --keep-selection opts out (tests/debugging, or regenerating from\n  an edited selection). Guards: skip deletion when selection path == context\n  path; tolerate unlink failure (warn, still succeed).\n- writing-plans native patch + wiki-researcher + wiki-selection contract\n  reworded: the selection is transient and consumed on success; to reselect\n  after a clean scaffold, re-run wiki-researcher rather than hand-rebuilding it.\n- Docs (USER_FLOW/DEVELOPMENT) updated: 4 \"report error -> fix shallow selection\n  and regenerate\" passages now read \"consume+remove on success / keep on error\".\n- wiki-context-scaffold-smoke.sh: assert happy-path removal + removal message,\n  --keep-selection preservation, and that a failed scaffold keeps the selection\n  (negative cases now build from a preserved pristine copy).\n\nVerified: ./manage.sh install && verify, and release-check (verify + doctor +\nself-test incl. scaffold/native-patch smokes + export-manifest) all pass.\nPending: live Claude Code writing-plans path acceptance.","tree":{"sha":"7af04235fbd95e3089248eca4586c827b554a9e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/7af04235fbd95e3089248eca4586c827b554a9e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/7071afe2bb6dfece5b9c5ac20c0c151e095c33f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/7071afe2bb6dfece5b9c5ac20c0c151e095c33f7","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDcwNzFhZmUyYmI2ZGZlY2U1YjljNWFjMjBjMGMxNTFlMDk1YzMzZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/05a5ff3f45b15d65e51f0548cf7512435ac2f696","sha":"05a5ff3f45b15d65e51f0548cf7512435ac2f696","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/05a5ff3f45b15d65e51f0548cf7512435ac2f696"}],"sha":"7071afe2bb6dfece5b9c5ac20c0c151e095c33f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/7071afe2bb6dfece5b9c5ac20c0c151e095c33f7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/05a5ff3f45b15d65e51f0548cf7512435ac2f696/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:49:23Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:49:23Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(wiki-context): mechanical generate-then-edit for .wiki-context.json\n\nReplace hand-authoring the wiki-context sidecar from an inline skeleton with\nmechanical generation, so the planning agent edits a complete structure instead\nof typing deep nested JSON from scratch (which dropped fields like reread /\ndestination / taskRouting and only failed validation late).\n\n- wiki-researcher now emits a strict JSON *selection* object; new contract\n  overlays/contracts/wiki-selection-v1.example.jsonc documents its shape. It\n  must not emit destination/reread/taskRouting/taskWikiRefs/globalWikiRefs/\n  taskFingerprint.\n- wiki_context_render.py gains two same-module subcommands (no schema drift):\n  * --scaffold <selection>: selection -> complete-shaped sidecar. Fills schema\n    constants, the taskRouting block, an auto reread block for every\n    hardConstraint section, the top-level sharedWiki identity for github_mcp,\n    and a default destination.kind (reason left empty so the author must\n    justify routing before --execution-ready).\n  * --scaffold-tasks --plan-path: one taskWikiRefs entry per stable plan\n    heading (taskId/taskTitle), idempotent and preserving author-entered\n    wikiRefs; never stamps fingerprints (--bind-fingerprints still owns that).\n- writing-plans native patch + wiki-researcher reworked to the generate-then-\n  edit flow; the inline skeleton is demoted to a generator-unavailable fallback.\n- New tests/wiki-context-scaffold-smoke.sh (wired into self-test) covers\n  scaffold structure, auto reread, sharedWiki capture, default destinations,\n  --scaffold-tasks idempotency + drift drop, full scaffold->edit->bind->preflight\n  chain, and malformed-selection rejection.\n- Docs (USER_FLOW/DEVELOPMENT/README) updated; also fixes stale `wiki\n  bind-fingerprints` / `wiki fingerprint-preflight` CLI forms to the real flags.\n\nVerified: ./manage.sh install && verify, and release-check (verify + doctor +\nself-test incl. scaffold/render/native-patch smokes + export-manifest) all pass.","tree":{"sha":"bab5a42a6a476d5c43ea51e9413257fbb2ca74c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/bab5a42a6a476d5c43ea51e9413257fbb2ca74c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/05a5ff3f45b15d65e51f0548cf7512435ac2f696","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/05a5ff3f45b15d65e51f0548cf7512435ac2f696","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDA1YTVmZjNmNDViMTVkNjVlNTFmMDU0OGNmNzUxMjQzNWFjMmY2OTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/165fcc7249190d4ab92f090b7b053331e5d29410","sha":"165fcc7249190d4ab92f090b7b053331e5d29410","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/165fcc7249190d4ab92f090b7b053331e5d29410"}],"sha":"05a5ff3f45b15d65e51f0548cf7512435ac2f696","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/05a5ff3f45b15d65e51f0548cf7512435ac2f696"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/165fcc7249190d4ab92f090b7b053331e5d29410/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:38:39Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T13:38:39Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(native-skill-patch): gitignore-aware spec/plan commit policy\n\nInject blocks into brainstorming/writing-plans so spec/plan docs under\ndocs/superpowers/ are committed only when their path is not git-ignored\n(git check-ignore), never via git add -f; otherwise leave on disk and\ntell the user to handle version control. Per-path, so specs and plans\ncan be governed independently via .gitignore.","tree":{"sha":"26db77c2fc82ff1752086f2b8bbdfb03fef08484","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/26db77c2fc82ff1752086f2b8bbdfb03fef08484"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/165fcc7249190d4ab92f090b7b053331e5d29410","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/165fcc7249190d4ab92f090b7b053331e5d29410","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDE2NWZjYzcyNDkxOTBkNGFiOTJmMDkwYjdiMDUzMzMxZTVkMjk0MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/8e80baa65e9a5578aaafbc5deac9e6f4d262df75","sha":"8e80baa65e9a5578aaafbc5deac9e6f4d262df75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/8e80baa65e9a5578aaafbc5deac9e6f4d262df75"}],"sha":"165fcc7249190d4ab92f090b7b053331e5d29410","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/165fcc7249190d4ab92f090b7b053331e5d29410"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/8e80baa65e9a5578aaafbc5deac9e6f4d262df75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:52:08Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:52:08Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"refactor: simplify source-of-truth enforcement","tree":{"sha":"fc0d399d427b463feb75b7bdcae21f540fa0a3ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/fc0d399d427b463feb75b7bdcae21f540fa0a3ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/8e80baa65e9a5578aaafbc5deac9e6f4d262df75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/8e80baa65e9a5578aaafbc5deac9e6f4d262df75","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDhlODBiYWE2NWU5YTU1NzhhYWFmYmM1ZGVhYzllNmY0ZDI2MmRmNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/95a86c7a9b93392cfd62ba8eca2c10dc2abee384","sha":"95a86c7a9b93392cfd62ba8eca2c10dc2abee384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/95a86c7a9b93392cfd62ba8eca2c10dc2abee384"}],"sha":"8e80baa65e9a5578aaafbc5deac9e6f4d262df75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/8e80baa65e9a5578aaafbc5deac9e6f4d262df75"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/95a86c7a9b93392cfd62ba8eca2c10dc2abee384/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T14:10:57Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T14:10:57Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"chore: remove obsolete maxWikiPages settings","tree":{"sha":"a04fd17bbb3712cb010aae2b43d147c80100a894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/a04fd17bbb3712cb010aae2b43d147c80100a894"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/95a86c7a9b93392cfd62ba8eca2c10dc2abee384","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/95a86c7a9b93392cfd62ba8eca2c10dc2abee384","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDk1YTg2YzdhOWI5MzM5MmNmZDYyYmE4ZWNhMmMxMGRjMmFiZWUzODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/9145c55d47510954ba57c0a09a46a7842a09d23a","sha":"9145c55d47510954ba57c0a09a46a7842a09d23a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/9145c55d47510954ba57c0a09a46a7842a09d23a"}],"sha":"95a86c7a9b93392cfd62ba8eca2c10dc2abee384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/95a86c7a9b93392cfd62ba8eca2c10dc2abee384"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/9145c55d47510954ba57c0a09a46a7842a09d23a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T11:20:33Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T11:22:43Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"📝 docs(integration,quickstart): refresh stale install inventories + fix broken refs\n\n- Replace the hand-maintained, drifted install-file lists with category summaries\n  that defer the authoritative complete list to manifest.json / `manage.sh status`\n  (the lists were missing migrate-wiki/lanhu-requirements/shared-wiki-mcp/\n  publish-shared-wiki, used renamed scripts, and listed the removed\n  wiki-progressive-disclosure skill).\n- ADAPTER_INTEGRATION: update the wiki-researcher input example to the current\n  shape (wikiRoots plural + sharedWikiSource, debug phase, no maxWikiPages input);\n  fix a backtick-corrupted scripts/init-wiki.py reference.\n- QUICKSTART: fix backtick-corrupted skill-invocation examples in the code fence\n  (`init-wiki` skill ... -> init-wiki skill ...), matching the doc convention.","tree":{"sha":"e0a84b70b8d1ee68317cb49f774af0d3ba252b7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/e0a84b70b8d1ee68317cb49f774af0d3ba252b7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/9145c55d47510954ba57c0a09a46a7842a09d23a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/9145c55d47510954ba57c0a09a46a7842a09d23a","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDkxNDVjNTVkNDc1MTA5NTRiYTU3YzBhMDlhNDZhNzg0MmEwOWQyM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/fd5337ad6ed2819b9c929dda325fba31c032cc30","sha":"fd5337ad6ed2819b9c929dda325fba31c032cc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/fd5337ad6ed2819b9c929dda325fba31c032cc30"}],"sha":"9145c55d47510954ba57c0a09a46a7842a09d23a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/9145c55d47510954ba57c0a09a46a7842a09d23a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/fd5337ad6ed2819b9c929dda325fba31c032cc30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T11:08:47Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T11:08:47Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"🔥 chore(docs): prune stale docs, untrack release-check artifact, drop removed-skill refs\n\n- Delete 4 stale/unreferenced docs: ARCHITECTURE_ANALYSIS_CN.md (described removed\n  wiki-progressive-disclosure + old single-root/maxWikiPages flow; superseded by\n  CLAUDE.md), mcp/shared-wiki/TESTING_TODO_CN.md (last round''s checklist, now\n  done/passing + taught the old config flow), LANHU_OUTPUT_PACKAGE_REFACTOR_PLAN.md\n  and LANHU_MCP_TEST_PLAN_CN.md (completed Lanhu refactor/test plans).\n- Untrack manifest-output.json (accidentally-committed release-check output with\n  ephemeral temp paths) and add it to .gitignore.\n- ADAPTER_INTEGRATION_CN.md / QUICKSTART_CN.md: drop the install-inventory line\n  pointing at the removed wiki-progressive-disclosure skill.","tree":{"sha":"7e890d8848285946c58f5845bc1b1426876104fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/7e890d8848285946c58f5845bc1b1426876104fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/fd5337ad6ed2819b9c929dda325fba31c032cc30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/fd5337ad6ed2819b9c929dda325fba31c032cc30","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGZkNTMzN2FkNmVkMjgxOWI5YzkyOWRkYTMyNWZiYTMxYzAzMmNjMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/98417223db37d6ab728ced6fc7715a78a7702f22","sha":"98417223db37d6ab728ced6fc7715a78a7702f22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/98417223db37d6ab728ced6fc7715a78a7702f22"}],"sha":"fd5337ad6ed2819b9c929dda325fba31c032cc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/fd5337ad6ed2819b9c929dda325fba31c032cc30"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/98417223db37d6ab728ced6fc7715a78a7702f22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T10:41:51Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T10:41:51Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(shared-wiki-mcp): serialize concurrent clone access with a per-repo lock\n\nConcurrent Claude Code sessions targeting the same shared wiki resolve to the same\ncloneDir and race on prepareBase (checkout -B + reset --hard), validatePatch\n(apply + reset), and createPatchPr — causing index.lock errors, ensureClean\nfalse-trips, or a read''s reset --hard clobbering another session''s in-flight PR.\n\n- lock.ts: withCloneLock() — atomic open(wx) advisory lock at <cloneDir>.lock\n  (sibling, so it never disturbs git clone), bounded acquire timeout, stale break\n  via holder-PID liveness (process.kill(pid,0)) with mtime fallback.\n- server.ts: wrap every clone-touching tool handler. Locking at the handler layer\n  (not inside git helpers) avoids self-deadlock since createPatchPr calls\n  validatePatch internally. Per-clone scope means different repos never block.\n- tests/lock.test.ts: mutual exclusion, release-on-completion, stale-lock break,\n  acquire timeout.\n\nVerified: vitest 56/56, shared-wiki-mcp policy/pr/copyable smokes, release-check.","tree":{"sha":"fc0287ef2571c3f219814f3eac590b14abb2fd24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/fc0287ef2571c3f219814f3eac590b14abb2fd24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/98417223db37d6ab728ced6fc7715a78a7702f22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/98417223db37d6ab728ced6fc7715a78a7702f22","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDk4NDE3MjIzZGIzN2Q2YWI3MjhjZWQ2ZmM3NzE1YTc4YTc3MDJmMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/cc667a0a16d3f81b9c988b61e3f92b3362f7aa5b","sha":"cc667a0a16d3f81b9c988b61e3f92b3362f7aa5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/cc667a0a16d3f81b9c988b61e3f92b3362f7aa5b"}],"sha":"98417223db37d6ab728ced6fc7715a78a7702f22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/98417223db37d6ab728ced6fc7715a78a7702f22"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/cc667a0a16d3f81b9c988b61e3f92b3362f7aa5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T10:31:19Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T10:31:19Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(shared-wiki-mcp): per-project connection via CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR + fail-closed binding\n\nMove the shared-wiki MCP connection from one global config/registration to a\nper-project binding, so a single generic repo-less registration lets different\nprojects target different shared wikis (configure-is-identity, no mismatch class).\n\n- config.ts: loadConfig reads wiki.sharedMcp from\n  <CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR>/.shared-superpowers/settings.json (precedence: env >\n  SHARED_WIKI_MCP_CONFIG file > project settings > default). No repo resolvable\n  -> fail closed. cacheDir stays machine-local. + vitest cases.\n- wiki_common.py: load_shared_wiki_mcp_binding(); export-manifest + doctor report\n  bound/unbound/incomplete/error binding state.\n- manage.sh shared-wiki-registration + shared-wiki-registration.sh: emit the\n  generic registration with resolved path; examples updated + per-project\n  settings example added.\n- sidecar: optional top-level sharedWiki identity (repoUrl+revision) in contract +\n  renderer; native skill patches verify shared_wiki_status.repoUrl on github_mcp\n  reread to detect rebinding drift.\n- docs: README, ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN, ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN, CLAUDE.md, mcp README.\n\nVerified: vitest 52/52, install, verify, full release-check (doctor binding +\nself-test smoke suite). Concurrent same-repo cloneDir locking deferred.","tree":{"sha":"33d658b54bfbabbfad92ef68fd2cd99f788f423d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/33d658b54bfbabbfad92ef68fd2cd99f788f423d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/cc667a0a16d3f81b9c988b61e3f92b3362f7aa5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/cc667a0a16d3f81b9c988b61e3f92b3362f7aa5b","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGNjNjY3YTBhMTZkM2Y4MWI5Yzk4OGI2MWUzZjkyYjMzNjJmN2FhNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/e06548b474409c3fbdf65cc0b03ed058c23d857c","sha":"e06548b474409c3fbdf65cc0b03ed058c23d857c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e06548b474409c3fbdf65cc0b03ed058c23d857c"}],"sha":"cc667a0a16d3f81b9c988b61e3f92b3362f7aa5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/cc667a0a16d3f81b9c988b61e3f92b3362f7aa5b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e06548b474409c3fbdf65cc0b03ed058c23d857c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T06:45:54Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T06:45:54Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(update-wiki): capture durable decisions via triple-filter + execution-candidate sidecar\n\nDecision triple-filter (grill-with-docs inspired):\n- Add a decision carve-out (hard-to-reverse + surprising + real-trade-off) alongside\n  the reuse threshold so important single-module decisions are not dropped. Reuse the\n  existing Design Decision template; reconcile rationale from durable sources (plan,\n  git diff/log, break-loop artifacts) at review time.\n\nExecution-candidate capture (anti context-loss):\n- New scratch sidecar docs/superpowers/plans/<plan-stem>.wiki-candidates.jsonl.\n- executing-plans: main agent appends candidates mid-flow (liberal capture).\n- subagent-driven-development: implementer/reviewer subagents return\n  durableKnowledgeCandidates; main agent serializes appends (sole writer, no race).\n- update-wiki consumes the sidecar as candidate input, then deletes it.\n- Defends against context compaction, end-of-flow recency bias, and SDD subagent isolation.\n\nupdate-wiki''s end gate (ownership/dedup/neutrality/authorization) is unchanged; the\nadditions only feed it raw candidate input. systematic-debugging keeps using break-loop.","tree":{"sha":"769b3993c62aae9e9083a82cd2809f3018b9b254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/769b3993c62aae9e9083a82cd2809f3018b9b254"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/e06548b474409c3fbdf65cc0b03ed058c23d857c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/e06548b474409c3fbdf65cc0b03ed058c23d857c","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGUwNjU0OGI0NzQ0MDljM2ZiZGY2NWNjMGIwM2VkMDU4YzIzZDg1N2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/ef6692ca2e6b82b28154fc2091e1a66e187ea663","sha":"ef6692ca2e6b82b28154fc2091e1a66e187ea663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/ef6692ca2e6b82b28154fc2091e1a66e187ea663"}],"sha":"e06548b474409c3fbdf65cc0b03ed058c23d857c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e06548b474409c3fbdf65cc0b03ed058c23d857c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/ef6692ca2e6b82b28154fc2091e1a66e187ea663/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:38:15Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T03:38:15Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(planning): stamp taskFingerprint mechanically via --bind-fingerprints\n\nTwo-phase task binding had no sanctioned \"write\" half: planning agents had to\nhand-write taskFingerprint (or copy skeleton placeholders), and --validate-only\nsilently ignored --plan-path, so placeholder/stale fingerprints passed planning\nvalidation and only failed later at the execution/SDD --fingerprint-preflight.\n\n- wiki_context_render.py / source_truth_render.py: add --bind-fingerprints to\n  stamp each task''s fingerprint from the reviewed plan and write the sidecar in\n  place (routing stays author-owned). Transactional: refuses to write on any\n  structural mismatch, so a clean bind guarantees the preflight passes.\n- --validate-only --execution-ready now runs the fingerprint preflight when\n  --plan-path is given, and placeholder digests (64 identical hex chars) are\n  rejected, closing the false-confidence gap at planning time.\n- writing-plans / executing-plans / SDD patches and both contracts now bind via\n  --bind-fingerprints instead of hand-writing; \"binding refresh\" points at it.\n- extend wiki-context / source-truth render smoke tests (round-trip, placeholder,\n  stale, drift) and verify.sh capability checks; sync USER_FLOW/README/DEV docs.","tree":{"sha":"11611902597a84950d4878e1b1abe7357489df38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/11611902597a84950d4878e1b1abe7357489df38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/ef6692ca2e6b82b28154fc2091e1a66e187ea663","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/ef6692ca2e6b82b28154fc2091e1a66e187ea663","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGVmNjY5MmNhMmU2YjgyYjI4MTU0ZmMyMDkxZTFhNjZlMTg3ZWE2NjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/e928ae27f1b5c938261b1fcfb7d31cb056993984","sha":"e928ae27f1b5c938261b1fcfb7d31cb056993984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e928ae27f1b5c938261b1fcfb7d31cb056993984"}],"sha":"ef6692ca2e6b82b28154fc2091e1a66e187ea663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/ef6692ca2e6b82b28154fc2091e1a66e187ea663"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e928ae27f1b5c938261b1fcfb7d31cb056993984/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T13:53:04Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T13:53:04Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(update-wiki): fire post-merge reminder regardless of local wiki markers\n\nThe post-merge hook previously gated on a local .superpowers/ or\n.shared-superpowers/ directory. That misses shared-wiki-only projects whose\nshared wiki is a globally-configured MCP server with no local footprint — the\nsetup actually in use — so the reminder would never fire there.\n\nRemove the local-wiki gate entirely: the hook now fires on any finalize merge\n(git merge / --continue / gh pr merge, incl. git -C <dir> merge) and relies on\nupdate-wiki''s own front gate to decide whether anything should persist (it\ndefaults to skip and reads project, local-shared, and remote MCP shared wiki\nonly when present). Direction guards stay: trunk-into-branch sync merges,\nconflicted merges (MERGE_HEAD), and --abort/non-merge commands stay silent.\n\nUpdates the hook smoke test (no-markers repo now fires), drops the\n.superpowers/.shared-superpowers content checks from verify.sh, and aligns\nREADME / ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN / ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN.","tree":{"sha":"522de2dc7af96600566374ad672d1fd487db0f4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/522de2dc7af96600566374ad672d1fd487db0f4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/e928ae27f1b5c938261b1fcfb7d31cb056993984","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/e928ae27f1b5c938261b1fcfb7d31cb056993984","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGU5MjhhZTI3ZjFiNWM5MzgyNjFiMWZjZmI3ZDMxY2IwNTY5OTM5ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/de9bf596b888c4a61dcc6ed9ef7ac1a61db06ca3","sha":"de9bf596b888c4a61dcc6ed9ef7ac1a61db06ca3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/de9bf596b888c4a61dcc6ed9ef7ac1a61db06ca3"}],"sha":"e928ae27f1b5c938261b1fcfb7d31cb056993984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e928ae27f1b5c938261b1fcfb7d31cb056993984"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/de9bf596b888c4a61dcc6ed9ef7ac1a61db06ca3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T11:59:15Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T11:59:15Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(update-wiki): remind to run update-wiki after branch-integration merges\n\nAdd a PostToolUse hook (hooks/post-merge-update-wiki, Bash matcher) so durable\nknowledge review is not lost when work is accepted outside\nfinishing-a-development-branch — e.g. a task paused for manual testing and later\nfinished with a bare `git merge` back to main or an iteration branch.\n\nThe hook keys off the merge action, not a fixed target branch: git merge,\ngit merge --continue, and gh pr merge (incl. git -C <dir> merge) all qualify. It\nstays silent for trunk-into-branch sync merges (exact direction via\nworktree-origin.json originalBranch when present, else a main/master/origin-HEAD\nheuristic), conflicted merges (MERGE_HEAD), --abort/--quit, non-merge commands,\nand projects without .superpowers/wiki/. The reminder is advisory and does not\nassert implementation is verified or complete. A pure-bash fast path skips\npython when the payload has no \"merge\" substring.\n\nhook_patch.py now manages a PostToolUse registration alongside SessionStart;\nuninstall removes only the adapter entry and drops the now-empty PostToolUse\nkey. Adds verify content checks, a behavior smoke test wired into self-test, and\ndocs in README / ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN / ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN.","tree":{"sha":"9dd5d8dee63937e52d95ef2d3013f15f0b9366f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/9dd5d8dee63937e52d95ef2d3013f15f0b9366f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/de9bf596b888c4a61dcc6ed9ef7ac1a61db06ca3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/de9bf596b888c4a61dcc6ed9ef7ac1a61db06ca3","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGRlOWJmNTk2Yjg4OGM0YTYxZGNjNmVkOWVmN2FjMWE2MWRiMDZjYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/a5c7abbc5f3f1cc1a643673fa82aad65c19a4a4f","sha":"a5c7abbc5f3f1cc1a643673fa82aad65c19a4a4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/a5c7abbc5f3f1cc1a643673fa82aad65c19a4a4f"}],"sha":"de9bf596b888c4a61dcc6ed9ef7ac1a61db06ca3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/de9bf596b888c4a61dcc6ed9ef7ac1a61db06ca3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/a5c7abbc5f3f1cc1a643673fa82aad65c19a4a4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T16:10:11Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T16:10:11Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"♻️ refactor(writing-plans): surface planning-only destination + review-category routing in planning gate\n\nplanning-only/global destinations and the review constraint category already exist and are enforced by wiki_context_render.py, but the always-loaded planning skeleton only demonstrated task-bound — so planners default to over-injecting design-embodied soft context into execution/review. Add a one-line skeleton comment (the 3 destination kinds) plus two concise sentences: when to pick planning-only (soft context the task text already embodies; never hardConstraint/direct), and how to make a rule reviewer-only via the review category instead of re-stating it to the implementer.","tree":{"sha":"9da6d86c17222aaf7a78bf6be5220300e4c81d35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/9da6d86c17222aaf7a78bf6be5220300e4c81d35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/a5c7abbc5f3f1cc1a643673fa82aad65c19a4a4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/a5c7abbc5f3f1cc1a643673fa82aad65c19a4a4f","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGE1YzdhYmJjNWYzZjFjYzFhNjQzNjczZmE4MmFhZDY1YzE5YTRhNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/e0dbb3c8ff0ff8ab047ec5120a16f86b0b6dcc84","sha":"e0dbb3c8ff0ff8ab047ec5120a16f86b0b6dcc84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e0dbb3c8ff0ff8ab047ec5120a16f86b0b6dcc84"}],"sha":"a5c7abbc5f3f1cc1a643673fa82aad65c19a4a4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/a5c7abbc5f3f1cc1a643673fa82aad65c19a4a4f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e0dbb3c8ff0ff8ab047ec5120a16f86b0b6dcc84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T15:25:47Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T15:25:47Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"♻️ refactor(source-truth): emit audit report only when there are findings; document hard-section reread boundary\n\nQ1 — conditional source-truth report:\nThe source-of-truth-verifier always writes the lightweight constraints sidecar but\nnow writes the full *.source-truth-report.json only when status is needs_revision /\nblocked or findings[] is non-empty. On a clean pass it writes a single file and sets\nsourceTruthReportPath (constraints) and outputReportPath (envelope) to null. Verified\nsafe by full-repo enumeration: nothing requires the report — execution skills and the\nsubagent model patch explicitly forbid reading it, source_truth_render.py has no\n''report'' reference, and the v2 constraints validator never requires sourceTruthReportPath.\nUpdates the verifier agent, the on-demand contract (contracts/source-truth-verification.md),\nand the flow docs; adds a render-smoke fixture proving a sourceTruthReportPath:null sidecar\nstill validates/preflights/renders, plus a ''Write the full report only when'' token assertion\nin verify.sh and native-wiki-patch-smoke.sh.\n\nQ2-A — hard-section reread boundary authoring rule:\nAdds guidance (ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN.md section-marker spec, migrate-wiki rule 6,\nupdate-wiki Step 9) that a hard-constraint section is reread in full at execution\n(including nested children inside its markers, no length limit), so hard markers should\nwrap the normative rule plus its do/don''t; the good/bad examples (规则+示例+常见错误) stay\ntogether per the existing merge rule and must never be externalized or lossily summarized\n(anti-patterns are the constraint boundary). Only compliance-irrelevant background/rationale\nor long example galleries move to the page overview (documentContext) or a soft sibling\nsection. Nesting is for citability, not for shrinking a parent''s reread.\n\nVerified: install / verify / native-wiki-patch-smoke / source-truth-{settings,render}-smoke\n/ wiki-context-json-render-smoke / release-check all green.","tree":{"sha":"cbd7910fd5612608e031b612358f87333bcf6c73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/cbd7910fd5612608e031b612358f87333bcf6c73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/e0dbb3c8ff0ff8ab047ec5120a16f86b0b6dcc84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/e0dbb3c8ff0ff8ab047ec5120a16f86b0b6dcc84","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGUwZGJiM2M4ZmYwZmY4YWIwNDdlYzUxMjBhMTZmODZiMGI2ZGNjODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/b0efd646457bd5e079cf9dfd2110df6b17482322","sha":"b0efd646457bd5e079cf9dfd2110df6b17482322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/b0efd646457bd5e079cf9dfd2110df6b17482322"}],"sha":"e0dbb3c8ff0ff8ab047ec5120a16f86b0b6dcc84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/e0dbb3c8ff0ff8ab047ec5120a16f86b0b6dcc84"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/b0efd646457bd5e079cf9dfd2110df6b17482322/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T14:16:19Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T14:16:19Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"♻️ refactor(writing-plans): slim planning context (inline wiki skeleton + deferred source-truth contract)\n\nReduce always-loaded planning prompt weight without weakening guardrails.\n\nR3: replace the \"read the ~200-line wiki-context contract every plan\" step with a\n~30-line inline schemaVersion 3 jsonc skeleton in the writing-plans patch; the full\ncontracts/wiki-context-v3.example.jsonc is now a fallback for when the skeleton is\ninsufficient or --validate-only --strict reports a structural error. The skeleton\nstates the load-bearing rules explicitly: hardConstraint -> reread required,\ndocumentContext is page-level only, github_mcp pages need wikiPath + revision.\n\nR4: move source-of-truth dispatch/envelope/two-phase-binding/validate/section detail\nout of the always-loaded writing-plans block into a new on-demand managed reference,\noverlays/contracts/source-truth-verification.md (registered in manifest.json, carries\nthe generated marker, placeholder resolves at install). The inline block keeps only the\nconditional trigger, the source_truth_settings.py --show-policy probe, the not_configured\nskip rule, and a mandatory pointer to the contract. The source-truth-report.json /\nsource-truth-constraints.json / \"full report is planning/audit only\" token assertions\nmoved from the writing_skill checks to the reference file in BOTH native-wiki-patch-smoke.sh\nand verify.sh.\n\nR8 regression guards:\n- writing-plans patch must not contain execution-only hard-reread directives\n  (## Hard Wiki Constraint Rereads, --reread-list).\n- source_truth_render.py must never reference the report (it consumes only the\n  constraints sidecar) — protects the R1 bounded-envelope two-file split.\n- source-of-truth-verifier.md carries the \"consumes only this constraints sidecar\"\n  invariant, asserted in smoke + verify; wiki_context_render.py reread validation gains\n  a do-not-remove comment.\n\nVerified: install / verify / native-wiki-patch-smoke / source-truth-{settings,render}-smoke\n/ wiki-context-json-render-smoke / release-check all green; installed writing-plans SKILL.md\nconfirmed (moved tokens gone, pointer + skeleton present, R8 negatives pass, placeholder\nresolved). Docs synced (USER_FLOW, DEVELOPMENT). Live Claude Code planning-path acceptance\nfor R3/R4 still pending, same class as R1''s subagent-Write caveat.","tree":{"sha":"b8b10d2156b4a2762c8c3cd725c8b8f432e158cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/b8b10d2156b4a2762c8c3cd725c8b8f432e158cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/b0efd646457bd5e079cf9dfd2110df6b17482322","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/b0efd646457bd5e079cf9dfd2110df6b17482322","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGIwZWZkNjQ2NDU3YmQ1ZTA3OWNmOWRmZDIxMTBkZjZiMTc0ODIzMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/7f53f797d9dc6754b7ab0e44b23a60d20b511acb","sha":"7f53f797d9dc6754b7ab0e44b23a60d20b511acb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/7f53f797d9dc6754b7ab0e44b23a60d20b511acb"}],"sha":"b0efd646457bd5e079cf9dfd2110df6b17482322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/b0efd646457bd5e079cf9dfd2110df6b17482322"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/7f53f797d9dc6754b7ab0e44b23a60d20b511acb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T13:32:00Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T13:32:00Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"♻️ refactor(source-truth): verifier self-writes artifacts, return bounded envelope\n\nTo keep the full source-truth report out of the planning context, the\nsource-of-truth-verifier now Writes both the report and the constraints\nsidecar to disk itself and returns only a bounded verdict envelope\n(status, paths, summary counts, constraintSet titles, blocking deltas,\nshort caveats). The unbounded assumptions[]/findings[] no longer transit\nthe main agent context.\n\nThe constraints sidecar stays two-phase: the verifier writes only raw\nconstraintSets (no taskRouting.status=confirmed / globalConstraintRefs /\ntaskConstraintRefs / taskFingerprint); the main planning flow reads it\nback and binds after task headings stabilize. The envelope excludes\ndestination routing. On a write failure the verifier falls back to\nreturning the file JSON inline so the main agent writes and verifies it.\n\nUpdates the writing-plans native patch and user/dev/README docs. Final\nacceptance still requires confirming subagent Write works on the installed\nClaude Code planning path.","tree":{"sha":"ae9791aba6c18a1f576c4082920a944f8c804397","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/ae9791aba6c18a1f576c4082920a944f8c804397"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/7f53f797d9dc6754b7ab0e44b23a60d20b511acb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/7f53f797d9dc6754b7ab0e44b23a60d20b511acb","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDdmNTNmNzk3ZDlkYzY3NTRiN2FiMGU0NGIyM2E2MGQyMGI1MTFhY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/77f2e7192472e07c62b5aeda124628f25e755a0c","sha":"77f2e7192472e07c62b5aeda124628f25e755a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/77f2e7192472e07c62b5aeda124628f25e755a0c"}],"sha":"7f53f797d9dc6754b7ab0e44b23a60d20b511acb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/7f53f797d9dc6754b7ab0e44b23a60d20b511acb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/77f2e7192472e07c62b5aeda124628f25e755a0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T13:31:38Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T13:31:38Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"🐛 fix(wiki-context): require reread block on hard-constraint sections\n\nexecution-ready validation did not enforce the contract rule that every\nhardConstraint section carries a `reread` block. A sidecar could pass\n`--validate-only --strict --execution-ready` while render_reread_list\nsilently skipped any hardConstraint section lacking `reread`, dropping the\nauthoritative full-text reread at execution — the most safety-critical path.\n\n_validate_execution_ready now fails when a hardConstraint section has no\n`reread` object. Adds a regression fixture asserting the failure.","tree":{"sha":"ae869fb92c7af2aa2047b14f163fab3ae1356251","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/ae869fb92c7af2aa2047b14f163fab3ae1356251"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/77f2e7192472e07c62b5aeda124628f25e755a0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/77f2e7192472e07c62b5aeda124628f25e755a0c","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDc3ZjJlNzE5MjQ3MmUwN2M2MmI1YWVkYTEyNDYyOGYyNWU3NTVhMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/f4bc647d7fb5bb0f8c656037c4fedd47ab71a7e5","sha":"f4bc647d7fb5bb0f8c656037c4fedd47ab71a7e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/f4bc647d7fb5bb0f8c656037c4fedd47ab71a7e5"}],"sha":"77f2e7192472e07c62b5aeda124628f25e755a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/77f2e7192472e07c62b5aeda124628f25e755a0c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/f4bc647d7fb5bb0f8c656037c4fedd47ab71a7e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:47:25Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:47:25Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"♻️ refactor(adapter): reduce default prompt weight","tree":{"sha":"f95d6b47a6e1b576dbfbd29edc0e0b02c745d0d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/f95d6b47a6e1b576dbfbd29edc0e0b02c745d0d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/f4bc647d7fb5bb0f8c656037c4fedd47ab71a7e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/f4bc647d7fb5bb0f8c656037c4fedd47ab71a7e5","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGY0YmM2NDdkN2ZiNWJiMGY4YzY1NjAzN2M0ZmVkZDQ3YWI3MWE3ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/94a5fc9f453394d5d5c332520c5bf16ff64c176d","sha":"94a5fc9f453394d5d5c332520c5bf16ff64c176d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/94a5fc9f453394d5d5c332520c5bf16ff64c176d"}],"sha":"f4bc647d7fb5bb0f8c656037c4fedd47ab71a7e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/f4bc647d7fb5bb0f8c656037c4fedd47ab71a7e5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/94a5fc9f453394d5d5c332520c5bf16ff64c176d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T15:46:09Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T15:46:09Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"refactor(fingerprint): collapse taskFingerprint to bare sha256 string\n\ntaskFingerprint was a 4-field object (algorithm/normalization/source/hash)\nwhere only hash is read by any code; algorithm/normalization are dead\nconstants and source was never consumed. Collapse it to a bare lowercase\nsha256 hex string. The algorithm is still declared once per sidecar via\ntaskRouting.fingerprintAlgorithm, so no documentation is lost.\n\nAlso compress the verbose post-review recovery prose in the wiki\npreflight-failure branches to a single sentence, while keeping the\ndo-not-reselect-wiki / do-not-call-wiki-researcher discipline intact.\n\nPreflight run logic and trigger points are unchanged: still exactly one\npreflight before execution, stop-on-failure. Drift detection is preserved.\n\nBreaking schema change with no backward compat (sidecars are per-plan\ntransient artifacts); stale in-flight sidecars must re-run the binding pass.","tree":{"sha":"03a6d0cf5325cacc76732c70ef03a612194edfb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/03a6d0cf5325cacc76732c70ef03a612194edfb2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/94a5fc9f453394d5d5c332520c5bf16ff64c176d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/94a5fc9f453394d5d5c332520c5bf16ff64c176d","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDk0YTVmYzlmNDUzMzk0ZDVkNWMzMzI1MjBjNWJmMTZmZjY0YzE3NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/fbb4f2c2934db462c00c2c56a055e08c15033a34","sha":"fbb4f2c2934db462c00c2c56a055e08c15033a34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/fbb4f2c2934db462c00c2c56a055e08c15033a34"}],"sha":"94a5fc9f453394d5d5c332520c5bf16ff64c176d","url":"https: