ereads","tree":{"sha":"4e51a253a310f70d1ade7d1b4858932ee657bd47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/4e51a253a310f70d1ade7d1b4858932ee657bd47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/3b54fd6bf700fee188d21c613d6d553490b8d63b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/3b54fd6bf700fee188d21c613d6d553490b8d63b","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDNiNTRmZDZiZjcwMGZlZTE4OGQyMWM2MTNkNmQ1NTM0OTBiOGQ2M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/1ac22590495c7646a15c30d6e621b58370fd2dc2","sha":"1ac22590495c7646a15c30d6e621b58370fd2dc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/1ac22590495c7646a15c30d6e621b58370fd2dc2"}],"sha":"3b54fd6bf700fee188d21c613d6d553490b8d63b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/3b54fd6bf700fee188d21c613d6d553490b8d63b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/1ac22590495c7646a15c30d6e621b58370fd2dc2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T07:47:54Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T07:47:54Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(lanhu): clean effective PRD artifacts","tree":{"sha":"89391b6c74f88d14f0d192d2076955b7c7bbb856","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/89391b6c74f88d14f0d192d2076955b7c7bbb856"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/1ac22590495c7646a15c30d6e621b58370fd2dc2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/1ac22590495c7646a15c30d6e621b58370fd2dc2","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKDFhYzIyNTkwNDk1Yzc2NDZhMTVjMzBkNmU2MjFiNTgzNzBmZDJkYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/ecb04a8b7eceb6034eb40754d57661782208cd90","sha":"ecb04a8b7eceb6034eb40754d57661782208cd90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/ecb04a8b7eceb6034eb40754d57661782208cd90"}],"sha":"1ac22590495c7646a15c30d6e621b58370fd2dc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/1ac22590495c7646a15c30d6e621b58370fd2dc2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/ecb04a8b7eceb6034eb40754d57661782208cd90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T03:52:33Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T03:52:33Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"✨ feat(lanhu): surface source contradictions via confirmation gate\n\nProduct source requirements are often self-contradictory (e.g. a field\nmarked required in one place and optional in another). Until now the\nLanhu analyst could silently pick one side or merge them, burying the\nconflict in the effective PRD until Superpowers brainstorming.\n\nThe analyst now opportunistically surfaces source-internal factual\ncontradictions while extracting scoped evidence and routes them as a\nneutral question through the existing confirmationGate — never resolving,\nmerging, or turning them into risk inference. Blocking classification\nreuses the product-level vs implementation-level rule; the new\n`impact: source-fact-conflict` value rides the existing gate, so no new\noutput schema or 矛盾分析 heading is added. Detection stays distinct from\nthe Lanhu-returned 遗漏/矛盾检查 label.\n\n- common.md: contradiction-handling rule + impact enum value\n  (frontend/backend analysts regenerated via sync_role_prd.py)\n- lanhu-requirements SKILL.md: step-19 clarification + checklist item\n- docs: ADAPTER_USER_FLOW_CN / ADAPTER_DEVELOPMENT_CN / README\n- tests: lanhu-contradiction-detection-smoke.sh wired into self-test.sh\n\nVerified: install, verify, all Lanhu smokes, multica build smoke,\nrelease-check.","tree":{"sha":"cb6f7038127a31c91311aebbbf5bb2f8dfa6398f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/cb6f7038127a31c91311aebbbf5bb2f8dfa6398f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/ecb04a8b7eceb6034eb40754d57661782208cd90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/ecb04a8b7eceb6034eb40754d57661782208cd90","node_id":"C_kwDOSIvnpNoAKGVjYjA0YThiN2VjZWI2MDM0ZWI0MDc1NGQ1NzY2MTc4MjIwOGNkOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commit/d1083bfbbd79d6760096a5b300697f64d1351fec","sha":"d1083bfbbd79d6760096a5b300697f64d1351fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/d1083bfbbd79d6760096a5b300697f64d1351fec"}],"sha":"ecb04a8b7eceb6034eb40754d57661782208cd90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/ecb04a8b7eceb6034eb40754d57661782208cd90"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/commits/d1083bfbbd79d6760096a5b300697f64d1351fec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T02:11:32Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T02:11:32Z","email":"ywj.hy@aliyun.com","name":"yewenjie"},"message":"Merge branch ''feat/lanhu-role-prd-package''","tree":{"sha":"9046da36efae69ba70e6c9d83722372e74c0f76e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/trees/9046da36efae69ba70e6c9d83722372e74c0f76e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YWJ-hy/superpowers-spec-adapter/git/commits/d1083bfbbd