=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujeet-pro","id":126489721,"login":"sujeet-pro","node_id":"U_kgDOB4oUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/commits/7d7703597142d41cd73aa21ec5bd497e84c4d0e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T22:48:56Z","email":"126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sujeet Jaiswal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T22:48:56Z","email":"126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sujeet Jaiswal"},"message":"feat: adopt pagesmith 0.11 + diagramkit 0.4 — upstream feed/sitemap/validators, optimized re-render, contrast gate ON\n\nRequires @pagesmith/site@^0.11.0 and diagramkit@^0.4.0 (unpublished at\ncommit time — package-lock.json refresh via `npm install` after both\npublish, before merging to main).\n\nScript collapse onto upstream:\n- postbuild.ts: hand-rolled sitemap/RSS writers replaced by\n  generateSitemap/generateFeed from @pagesmith/site/ssg-utils (RSS\n  byte-identical; sitemap home-loc canonicalized). Keeps 404 flattening.\n- diagrams.ts / validate-diagrams.ts: thin wrappers over diagramkit\n  render/validate --scope-dir diagrams with a --fail-on policy;\n  LOW_CONTRAST_TEXT is now FATAL (gate on, 0 findings).\n- validate-dist.ts: delegates to validateBuildOutput (checkSitemap +\n  checkBundledAssets + hash enforcement); keeps repo-specific document\n  shape + Pagefind checks; ~180 duplicated lines gone.\n\nDiagram corpus:\n- All 1,301 sources re-rendered through the SVG-optimization pipeline:\n  2,602 SVGs, 95.4 MB -> 67.1 MB (-29.6%). dist 169 MB -> 142 MB.\n- 192 render manifests now committed (.gitignore un-ignores them) —\n  fresh clones no longer need Chromium when sources are unchanged.\n- All 84 WCAG contrast findings resolved: 48 via upstream diagramkit\n  theme fix, 28 via per-source palette fixes preserving design intent\n  (AA reds/greens/ambers), 8 were scanner false-positives fixed\n  upstream. validate:diagrams now enforces contrast fatally.\n\nDocs/guidance updated (postbuild/validators/diagram policy, upstream\nskill-stub install deferred until published packages are installed —\nsee AGENTS.md note).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LTjUU8fS8zapQPmzwFr8GK","tree":{"sha":"ea768b0e1d92fec808885dce792e2018f1dd7441","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/git/trees/ea768b0e1d92fec808885dce792e2018f1dd7441"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/git/commits/7d7703597142d41cd73aa21ec5bd497e84c4d0e1","verification":{"payload":"tree ea768b0e1d92fec808885dce792e2018f1dd7441\nparent d100e3fa9f3d166724aa50754670eeb235d68926\nauthor Sujeet Jaiswal <126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com> 1784674136 +0530\ncommitter Sujeet Jaiswal <126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com> 1784674136 +0530\n\nfeat: adopt pagesmith 0.11 + diagramkit 0.4 — upstream feed/sitemap/validators, optimized re-render, contrast gate ON\n\nRequires @pagesmith/site@^0.11.0 and diagramkit@^0.4.0 (unpublished at\ncommit time — package-lock.json refresh via `npm install` after both\npublish, before merging to main).\n\nScript collapse onto upstream:\n- postbuild.ts: hand-rolled sitemap/RSS writers replaced by\n  generateSitemap/generateFeed from @pagesmith/site/ssg-utils (RSS\n  byte-identical; sitemap home-loc canonicalized). Keeps 404 flattening.\n- diagrams.ts / validate-diagrams.ts: thin wrappers over diagramkit\n  render/validate --scope-dir diagrams with a --fail-on policy;\n  LOW_CONTRAST_TEXT is now FATAL (gate on, 0 findings).\n- validate-dist.ts: delegates to validateBuildOutput (checkSitemap +\n  checkBundledAssets + hash enforcement); keeps repo-specific document\n  shape + Pagefind checks; ~180 duplicated lines gone.\n\nDiagram corpus:\n- All 1,301 sources re-rendered through the SVG-optimization pipeline:\n  2,602 SVGs, 95.4 MB -> 67.1 MB (-29.6%). dist 169 MB -> 142 MB.\n- 192 render manifests now committed (.gitignore un-ignores them) —\n  fresh clones no longer need Chromium when sources are unchanged.\n- All 84 WCAG contrast findings resolved: 48 via upstream diagramkit\n  theme fix, 28 via per-source palette fixes preserving design intent\n  (AA reds/greens/ambers), 8 were scanner false-positives fixed\n  upstream. validate:diagrams now enforces contrast fatally.\n\nDocs/guidance updated (postbuild/validators/diagram policy, upstream\nskill-stub install deferred until published packages are installed —\nsee AGENTS.md note).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LTjUU8fS8zapQPmzwFr8GK\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+rIICZN3ROkPEATMLuPdRYq8Ya\nvyluP7xYmVA8gOj5wAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQL9eaT4ig41pQIZj8ZqExecIxr6etllIXYHUGguZR7R+rcy07K7yCPfgPKfuMmsWfu\nFWIqtIEKftwbV6dgz0QQM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-22T07:32:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126489721?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujeet-pro","id":126489721,"login":"sujeet-pro","node_id":"U_kgDOB4oUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/commit/7d7703597142d41cd73aa21ec5bd497e84c4d0e1","node_id":"C_kwDOSIxvO9oAKDdkNzcwMzU5NzE0MmQ0MWNkNzNhYTIxZWM1YmQ0OTdlODRjNGQwZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/commit/d100e3fa9f3d166724aa50754670eeb235d68926","sha":"d100e3fa9f3d166724aa50754670eeb235d68926","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/commits/d100e3fa9f3d166724aa50754670eeb235d68926"}],"sha":"7d7703597142d41cd73aa21ec5bd497e84c4d0e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/commits/7d7703597142d41cd73aa21ec5bd497e84c4d0e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126489721?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sujeet-pro","id":126489721,"login":"sujeet-pro","node_id":"U_kgDOB4oUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/commits/d100e3fa9f3d166724aa50754670eeb235d68926/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:56:19Z","email":"126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sujeet Jaiswal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:56:19Z","email":"126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sujeet Jaiswal"},"message":"chore: version-independent hardening and polish\n\n- Pin vite-plus to ^0.1.19 (was floating \"latest\" resolving to a stale\n  0.1.18; now 0.1.24, clearing the <=0.1.23 advisory range), add\n  engines.node >=24, and make \"test\" an explicit non-watch `vp test run`\n  (CI aligned).\n- Collapse CLAUDE.md into the native @AGENTS.md import; AGENTS.md absorbs\n  everything CLAUDE.md uniquely carried (they had measurably drifted).\n- Dedupe the four cross-reference checks previously copy-pasted between\n  scripts/validate.ts and scripts/validate-pagesmith.ts into\n  lib/cross-references.ts.\n- site.config.json5: wire favicon/faviconFallback/appleTouchIcon (assets\n  existed but were never linked).\n- Preload the JetBrains Mono code font next to Open Sans (new\n  FontPreload headChildren component across all four layouts).\n- CI: gate on validate:content, validate:full, and validate:diagrams\n  (static SVG validation, browser-free job).\n- README org attribution fix; ai-guidelines drop hardcoded version\n  banners in favor of reading node_modules; remove dead projects/\n  collection guidance.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LTjUU8