ia the modal toggle on every viewport.\n\nUpdate the two affected tests to match the new structure so the build &\ne2e job goes green again.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"d7b23df4849beefc04c67db076bc7e18d5023df3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/git/trees/d7b23df4849beefc04c67db076bc7e18d5023df3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/git/commits/7ac9d5e3ee105aa74cec7be4d426363c20950f13","verification":{"payload":"tree d7b23df4849beefc04c67db076bc7e18d5023df3\nparent 7905b684183626aa9a72a79dc849d1a4e9207383\nauthor Sujeet Jaiswal <126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com> 1776724613 +0530\ncommitter Sujeet Jaiswal <126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com> 1776724613 +0530\n\nfix(e2e): align sidebar tests with pagesmith 0.9.9 markup\n\nAfter the @pagesmith/site bump, the docs sidebar changed shape:\n- The first .doc-sidebar-heading is now the literal label \"Series\", and\n  the series title appears as the first link inside the active item.\n- Listing pages no longer render the persistent .doc-sidebar aside; the\n  sidebar is exposed via the modal toggle on every viewport.\n\nUpdate the two affected tests to match the new structure so the build &\ne2e job goes green again.\n\nMade-with: Cursor\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgi6zpiTH+gOIYvKjmL9bpRxVFyU\nPpWOq5+lnV0Qkf39wAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQODHp2jesVNxSBS95+EyuycP+UtlWaPo/1xVYRK/vWCmz0MfY3ztIk5/ZTJM3+2r87\nAJLBBr9Db26xOh0IF+PAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-21T16:01:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126489721?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.co