ers/sujeet-pro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sujeet-pro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/commits/7905b684183626aa9a72a79dc849d1a4e9207383/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T22:28:01Z","email":"126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sujeet Jaiswal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T22:28:01Z","email":"126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sujeet Jaiswal"},"message":"fix(ci): regenerate lockfile to drop stale ../diagramkit link\n\nThe previous commit updated package.json but `npm install` reused the\nstale lockfile entry that still pointed diagramkit at the local\n../diagramkit folder, so CI kept failing with `spawn diagramkit ENOENT`.\nRegenerated package-lock.json from scratch so diagramkit resolves to the\nnpm registry tarball.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"89aab07398a78d0070b49aea88d5604078da303c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/git/trees/89aab07398a78d0070b49aea88d5604078da303c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/git/commits/7905b684183626aa9a72a79dc849d1a4e9207383","verification":{"payload":"tree 89aab07398a78d0070b49aea88d5604078da303c\nparent 9ca1efb6b999d6c5eab00d7a55a940f50677eb48\nauthor Sujeet Jaiswal <126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com> 1776724081 +0530\ncommitter Sujeet Jaiswal <126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com> 1776724081 +0530\n\nfix(ci): regenerate lockfile to drop stale ../diagramkit link\n\nThe previous commit updated package.json but `npm install` reused the\nstale lockfile entry that still pointed diagramkit at the local\n../diagramkit folder, so CI kept failing with `spawn diagramkit ENOENT`.\nRegenerated package-lock.json from scratch so diagramkit resolves to the\nnpm registry tarball.\n\nMade-with: Cursor\n","reason":"vali