rapped image now ships a hover-revealed\nexpand button (hidden without JS) and the modal serves the new\nhigh-res `<stem>.zoom.webp` variant for raster sources. Themed\nSVG pairs render via the source `<picture>`''s `currentSrc` so they\nswap correctly on theme toggle. The shared site asset-rewriter\n(`rewriteContentAssetRefs`) and the asset hasher both learn the new\n`data-zoom-src` / `data-zoom-src-light` / `data-zoom-src-dark`\nattributes so they publish to the same hashed URLs as `src`/`srcset`.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"412105c27238ad94319ad335b9c1d13016c76f87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/git/trees/412105c27238ad94319ad335b9c1d13016c76f87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sujeet-pro/sujeet.pro/git/commits/9f2152e3d56fd4a9c9fda3a9615d1560239649fc","verification":{"payload":"tree 412105c27238ad94319ad335b9c1d13016c76f87\nparent 443538ca8d4ac25c3ea70f3854d99850780ee907\nauthor Sujeet Jaiswal <126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com> 1776716954 +0530\ncommitter Sujeet Jaiswal <126489721+sujeet-pro@users.noreply.github.com> 1776716954 +0530\n\nchore(deps): bump @pagesmith/site to 0.9.9\n\nPicks up the new image-zoom modal HTML + asset-emission caps from\npagesmith. Every figure-wrapped image now ships a hover-revealed\nexpand button (hidden without JS) and the modal serves the new\nhigh-res `<stem>.zoom.webp` variant for raster sources. Themed\nSVG pairs render via the source `<picture>`''s `currentSrc` so they\nswap correctly on theme toggle. The shared site asset-rewriter\n(`rewriteContentAssetRefs`) and the asset hasher both learn the new\n`data-zoom-src` / `data-zoom-src-light` / `data-zoom-src-dark`\nattributes so they publish to the same hashed URLs as `src`/`srcset`.\n\nMade-with: Cursor\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgi6zpiTH+gOIYvKjmL9bpRxVFyU\nPpWOq5+lnV0Qkf39wAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBWGhyMSlL3kM