l":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meowrhino/polroig1/commits/36981af5228535064e8d7c4acbe6651a2d9261d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T19:42:25Z","email":"manuellatourf@gmail.com","name":"manu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T19:42:25Z","email":"manuellatourf@gmail.com","name":"manu"},"message":"feat: wheel-centred layout, view transitions, tap-to-open mirilla\n\n- Home layout: wheel fixed at viewport centre on load, content flows below\n  on mobile; bottom-corner bio/synopsis on desktop with a larger wheel.\n- Header + content share max-width + pad-x so edges align across breakpoints.\n- Logo \"pol roig\" now rotates the wheel to the bio slot.\n- Mirilla (centre of wheel) is tappable and opens the active project.\n- View Transitions API: mirilla morph + root cross-fade between home and\n  project, with prefers-reduced-motion fallback.\n- Project page: stagger-in of content and IntersectionObserver-based\n  fade-in for gallery images.\n- Wheel snap uses a small overshoot easing for a more tactile feel.\n- Focus-visible rings, grab/grabbing cursor, arrow on view-project link.\n- Page title synced in route() so it updates before render.\n- Landscape mobile: wheel capped by dvh to avoid overflow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50fb49c53251d81aa31e8b64a6f20ca9b34ee58f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meowrhino/polroig1/git/trees/50fb49c53251d81aa31e8b64a6f20ca9b34ee58f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meowrhino/polroig1/git/commits/36981af5228535064e8d7c4acbe6651a2d9261d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconte