S build-arg toggle for networks that block HTTP but allow HTTPS\n- Re-declare all compression ARGs in runtime stage scope (--build-arg now works)\n- Fix COMPRESSION_LEVEL default to 4 (matches documented Docker behavior)\n- Remove dead SKILL_COMPRESSION_STRATEGY (not consumed by app)\n- Remove chromium package (absent from Alpine, glibc-only won''t run on musl)\n- Remove dead global ARGs (ENABLE_LLM_COMPRESSION, OPENAI_MODEL)\n- Fix multi-stage ARG scoping comment","tree":{"sha":"c6f9f4dd7e57931d6c02b8828b6857dec7f642aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/git/trees/c6f9f4dd7e57931d6c02b8828b6857dec7f642aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/git/commits/65545b427f4f2629c6e98a6775e28486bd13edef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commit/65545b427f4f2629c6e98a6775e28486bd13edef","node_id":"C_kwDOSI8Ra9oAKDY1NTQ1YjQyN2Y0ZjI2MjljNmU5OGE2Nzc1ZTI4NDg2YmQxM2VkZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commit/38a28a8cfb075bbed0e223dea69c261207e920a5","sha":"38a28a8cfb075bbed0e223dea69c261207e920a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/38a28a8cfb075bbed0e223dea69c261207e920a5"}],"sha":"65545b427f4f2629c6e98a6775e28486bd13edef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/65545b427f4f2629c6e98a6775e28486bd13edef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-ac