.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/9d9f7ed76b43814485e78594fd7d948f307aec3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T16:24:49Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T16:24:49Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"fix: restore $1 backreferences in HTML-to-markdown conversion\n\nsplit().join() discards captured groups — it uses the replacement\nstring literally, producing \"# $1 > ## $1\" instead of actual headings\nlike \"# Prometheus > ## Configuration\". Switched all heading/p/li\nconversions to .replace() which properly resolves $1 backreferences.\nFixed in both extractKeyContent() and transformExternalContent().","tree":{"sha":"802d5a6d6d9b336a8b3486d72f27485d8988a499","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/git/trees/802d5a6d6d9b336a8b3486d72f27485d8988a499"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/git/commits/9d9f7ed76b43814485e78594fd7d948f307aec3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commit/9d9f7ed76b43814485e78594fd7d948f307aec3e","node_id":"C_kwDOSI8Ra9oAKDlkOWY3ZWQ3NmI0MzgxNDQ4NWU3ODU5NGZkN2Q5NDhmMzA3YWVjM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commit/fb38c0f51db774e58484af79a1f4cd228173ddf3","sha":"fb38c0f51db774e58484af79a1f4cd228173ddf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/fb38c0f51db774e58484af79a1f4cd228173ddf3"}],"sha":"9d9f7ed76b43814485e78594fd7d948f307aec3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/9d9f7ed76b43814485e78594fd7d948f307aec3e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/fb38c0f51db774e58484af79a1f4cd228173ddf3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T16:02:04Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T16:02:04Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat: log actual injected content for all external link paths\n\nPreviously logged metadata only (chunk counts, similarity scores).\nNow logs the full formatted reference text that actually gets added\nto the skill prompt, gated by DEBUG_ROUTING_CONTENT=true:\n\n- Semantic filter: \"Semantic filter injected content\" with url,\n  chunkCount, totalSize, and 1000-char preview of final output\n- Inline injection: logs formatReference output instead of raw text\n- Truncated injection: logs formatReference output instead of raw\n- LLM compressed: logs formatReference output instead of raw\n- Fallback truncated: logs formatReference output instead of raw\n\nThis lets users verify exactly what text reaches OpenCode.","tree":{"sha":"482673e801281fcd9aa05331dc4ce3700fac4019","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/git/trees/482673e801281fcd9aa05331dc4ce3700fac4019"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/git/commits/fb38c0f51db774e58484af79a1f4cd228173ddf3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commit/fb38c0f51db774e58484af79a1f4cd228173ddf3","node_id":"C_kwDOSI8Ra9oAKGZiMzhjMGY1MWRiNzc0ZTU4NDg0YWY3OWExZjRjZDIyODE3M2RkZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commit/8a2b1408dc1e11601eb3aa44cf08b9c7affc088a","sha":"8a2b1408dc1e11601eb3aa44cf08b9c7affc088a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/8a2b1408dc1e11601eb3aa44cf08b9c7affc088a"}],"sha":"fb38c0f51db774e58484af79a1f4cd228173ddf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/fb38c0f51db774e58484af79a1f4cd228173ddf3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/8a2b1408dc1e116