MCP bridge output\n\n- Add extractDomainFromContent() to parse domain from SKILL.md YAML frontmatter\n- Add formatDomainLabel() to format domain as human-readable labels\n- Modify handleRouteToSkill() to:\n  - Extract domain metadata when loading skill content\n  - Prepend domain context to skill headings (e.g., ''# risk-stop-loss [Trading]'')\n  - Log domain context in skill access logs\n- Update body construction to include domain labels for each skill\n- Both .config/opencode and agent-skill-routing-system versions updated\n\nThis makes domain context visible to OpenCode users without modifying OpenCode source.\nDomain labels appear prominently in skill headings while being non-intrusive.","tree":{"sha":"7b9eb0b0dd30cd19838f757ee420a5183bb730ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/git/trees/7b9eb0b0dd30cd19838f757ee420a5183bb730ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/git/commits/9b596f48b7cb528b67d4637f42b3fd83e980b137","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commit/9b596f48b7cb528b67d4637f42b3fd83e980b137","node_id":"C_kwDOSI8Ra9oAKDliNTk2ZjQ4YjdjYjUyOGI2N2Q0NjM3ZjQyYjNmZDgzZTk4MGIxMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commit/ddfee28dc3660f7986c2407036d9a47bd483cfdb","sha":"ddfee28dc3660f7986c2407036d9a47bd483cfdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/ddfee28dc3660f7986c2407036d9a47bd483cfdb"}],"sha":"9b596f48b7cb528b67d4637f42b3fd83e980b137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/9b596f48b7cb528b67d4637f42b3fd83e980b137"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/ddfee28dc3660f7986c2407036d9a47bd483cfdb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T19:37:13Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_c