://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/5a3f05d277d4dabf75126e7024a37c721e7b0ca8"}],"sha":"d37db3426b280d7d01651b03c839f12992095e1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/d37db3426b280d7d01651b03c839f12992095e1c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commits/5a3f05d277d4dabf75126e7024a37c721e7b0ca8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T16:49:35Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T16:49:35Z","email":"opencode@local","name":"OpenCode"},"message":"feat: wire attribution footer into Router.routeTask() pipeline with skill count\n\nPhase 1 Implementation Summary:\n- Wire Router.routeTask() to generate attribution footer after skill selection\n- Add skill count display to all footer format headers (markdown, plaintext, html)\n- Generate footer from SkillRegistry metadata with graceful error handling\n- Implement error handling that logs warnings but doesn''t propagate failures\n\nFile Changes:\n\n1. Router.ts (core routing pipeline)\n   - Add import: AttributionFooter, SkillAttribution\n   - Insert footer generation after score explanations (line 448-495)\n   - Collect skill metadata from SkillRegistry for each selected skill\n   - Call AttributionFooter.generate() with parsed metadata\n   - Add footer to response.attributionFooter field (optional, non-breaking)\n   - Wrap in try-catch to gracefully skip footer on any error\n   - Log at debug level when footer generated, warn level on failures\n   - Only generate footer if we have skill metadata available\n\n2. AttributionFooter.ts (footer generation)\n   - Update markdown header: ''**Skills Used:**'' → ''**Skills Used (N):**''\n   - Update HTML header: ''<strong>Skills Used:</strong>'' → ''<strong>Skills Used (N):</strong>''\n   - Update plaintext header: ''Skills Used:'' → ''Skills Used (N):''\n   - All three formats now display skill count in parentheses\n\n3. AttributionFooter.test.ts (test coverage)\n   - Fix 1 existing assertion: expect ''Skills Used (2):'' instead of ''Skills Used:''\n   - Add 6 new test cases in ''skill count display'' describe block:\n     * Verify markdown footer shows correct count for multiple skills\n     * Verify single skill shows count of 1\n     * Verify plaintext format displays count correctly\n     * Verify HTML format displays count correctly\n     * Verify empty skills array returns no footer\n     * Verify 5-skill footer displays correct count\n\nCode Philosophy Compliance:\n✅ Early Exit: Guard clauses at function top (skill count check, metadata validation)\n✅ Parse Don''t Validate: Data parsed into SkillAttribution at boundaries\n✅ Atomic Predictability: Pure footer generation, no side effects\n✅ Fail Fast: Missing metadata logged, footer skipped gracefully\n✅ Intentional Naming: skillRegistry, skillAttributions, AttributionFooter read clearly\n\nNon-Breaking Changes:\n- attributionFooter field is optional (?) in RouteResponse\n- Footer generation only occurs when skills are selected\n- Errors caught and logged, never propagated\n- Existing routing logic unchanged\n- All consumers of RouteResponse remain compatible","tree":{"sha":"e913f8ae29700681be3b3bdabb12f1bdbbb6621c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/git/trees/e913f8ae29700681be3b3bdabb12f1bdbbb6621c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpas/agent-skill-router/git/commits/5a3f05d277d4dabf75126e7024a37c721e7b0ca8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commit/5a3f05d277d4dabf75126e7024a37c721e7b0ca8","node_id":"C_kwDOSI8Ra9oAKDVhM2YwNWQyNzdkNGRhYmY3NTEyNmU3MDI0YTM3YzcyMWU3YjBjYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpas/agent-skill-router/commit/4d04c29beb954ae84224e93a70ad0bae1c544b21","sha":"4d04c29beb954ae84224e93a70ad0bae1c544b21","