eived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ambrovanwyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ambrovanwyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ambrovanwyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ambrovanwyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ambrovw/smeltwaarde/commits/d2ced8ce4099c5aadb52bd216ac39fc5da7327d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T23:40:28Z","email":"ambro@ambrovanwyk.com","name":"Ambro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T23:40:28Z","email":"ambro@ambrovanwyk.com","name":"Ambro"},"message":"Add Koop/Verkoop page with rate card, contact form, and seller flow\n\n- New /koopVerkoop route + nav entry: rate table (koop/verkoop % relative\n  to live melt value per category) with condition disclaimer, bilingual.\n- Contact form in a modal: name, email, optional cellphone with\n  Call/WhatsApp selector, message; backed by a SAM-managed Lambda\n  (backend/contact-form) that emails admin@ via SES (eu-west-1).\n  Abuse protection: honeypot, min fill-time, per-container rate limit,\n  reserved concurrency, length caps.\n- Verkoop button on both calculators: opens the form prefilled with a\n  read-only breakdown of selected coins + the ?deel= share link, plus an\n  optional notes field and a link to the rates page.\n- Deel button now always visible, disabled when nothing is entered.\n- Munt Hoeveelhede gets the standard logo header; non-calculator pages\n  get consistent top spacing below the fixed nav.\n- Removed the \"Wil jy dit vir jou webwerf he?\" footer CTA everywhere.\n- Modals no longer close when a drag ends outside the card.\n- scripts/deploy_qa.sh deploys to qa.smeltwaarde.co.za (noindex QA env).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b8ba8e82ec9cac1a6ea032bd8b2d37810fb51509","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ambrovw/smeltwaarde/git/trees/b8ba8e82e