:"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/92e15faeff279e727ec0d283aa78b57224f7d34a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T01:24:44Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T01:24:44Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"message":"security: add securityHeaders middleware (clears ZAP DAST findings)\n\nZAP baseline flagged missing security headers on the IdP''s browser-facing\npages (login/consent/index). Add a securityHeaders middleware to the chi\nstack setting:\n- Content-Security-Policy (script-src strict ''self''; style-src allows\n  ''unsafe-inline'' for the templates'' embedded <style> blocks)\n- X-Frame-Options: DENY + frame-ancestors ''none'' (clickjacking defense —\n  a consent screen must never be framable)\n- X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy\n\nResult: both Medium findings cleared (9->6 warns, 58->61 pass, 0 FAIL/High).\nRemaining warns are Low/Info and intentionally left (COEP/COOP can break\nOAuth redirect flows; return_to hotspot is non-exploitable per html/template\n+ validateReturnTo). Documented in notes.md.","tree":{"sha":"783f901045bc26cd1cdf5f82a9639d3c2de01d4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/trees/783f901045bc26cd1cdf5f82a9639d3c2de01d4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/commits/92e15faeff279e727ec0d283aa78b57224f7d34a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/pri