bury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/1fab80c14ae14537069a89b54be489be9a489429/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T01:05:31Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T01:05:31Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"message":"security: bump Go toolchain to 1.25.12 and add security-scan tooling\n\nPin toolchain to go1.25.12 (was building with 1.25.0). govulncheck went\nfrom 26 reachable stdlib CVEs to 0 affecting our code.\n\nFix pre-existing test build failures: users.Store gained CreateWithID\nbut the fakeUserStore / memUserStore test doubles never implemented it.\nAdd matching stubs so the http + admin test packages compile again.\n\nAdd layered `make security-scan` (govulncheck, gosec, trivy fs/image,\nnpm audit) plus `make sec-dast` (ZAP baseline) and `make sec-tools`.\nReports write to gitignored sec-reports/.","tree":{"sha":"1ea574b507e2b9311dc911d81aa52ac0521ff4b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/trees/1ea574b507e2b9311dc911d81aa52ac0521ff4b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/commits/1fab80c14ae14537069a89b54be489be9a489429","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhock