entity-provider/commits/676f74997de332d7aa25c4a975dcc6bc0e7fa911/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T03:38:15Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T03:38:15Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"message":"docs-api: postgres persistence (sqlc + goose) + service-boundary grant CLI\n\nTwo related changes — the persistence move forced the boundary cleanup.\n\nPersistence (sqlc + goose):\n- New postgres-docs container in docker-compose (host :5435).\n- Goose-managed schema in cmd/docs-api/migrations/: 0001_init.sql for\n  folders + documents, 0002_seed.sql for the deterministic demo corpus.\n- sqlc generates typed Go from cmd/docs-api/queries.sql into db/.\n  Modern Go default — schema-first SQL, no runtime ORM.\n- `corpus.go` is now a thin wrapper over the generated db.Queries; the\n  handler-facing Document/Folder shapes stay wire-stable.\n- Handler call signatures gained ctx + error returns. Tests use a\n  fakeStore implementing the new documentStore interface.\n- New `make migrate-docs` target; `make dev-up` runs it before bringing\n  services up.\n\nService-boundary cleanup:\n- `idp users create --id <uuid>` flag + users.CreateWithID for\n  fixed-UUID provisioning. Dev seed (`make dev-user`) pins alice to\n  aaaaaaaa-... so seeded FGA tuples + integration tests don''t drift\n  across `make dev-reset`.\n- New `docs-api grant <user-uuid> <role> <resource>` CLI. Lives on\n  docs-api (not idp) because the vocabulary (owner/editor/viewer on\n  folder/document) is docs-api''s. The IdP shouldn''t know that.\n- Removed SeedFGA + DOCS_SEED_ALICE/BOB/CAROL env vars. Tuples are\n  no longer written at docs-api startup; that was a layer violation\n  and the source of the alice-UUID-drift bug.\n- `make dev-grant` calls `docs-api grant` for the seeded corpus\n  (viewer on Public, editor on Engineering, owner on Private Notes).\n  Wired into dev-up so the dev user is always granted on boot.","tree":{"sha":"0d5826d998a5ab452165cf13a263055736eb1b7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/trees/0d5826d998a5ab452165cf13a263055736eb1b7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/commits/676f74997de332d7aa25c4a975dcc6bc0e7fa911","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury","id":2676257,"login":"mhockenbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzYyNTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/676f74997de332d7aa25c4a975dcc6bc0e7fa911","node_id":"C_kwDOSJFenNoAKDY3NmY3NDk5N2RlMzMyZDdhYTI1YzRhOTc1ZGNjNmJjMGU3ZmE5MTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/30037f49efb3d3b48b3f0216c4e7d10d1502e715","sha":"30037f49efb3d3b48b3f0216c4e7d10d1502e715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/30037f49efb3d3b48b3f0216c4e7d10d1502e715"}],"sha":"676f74997de332d7aa25c4a975dcc6bc0e7fa911","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/676f74997de332d7aa25c4a975dcc6bc0e7fa911"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury","id":2676257,"login":"mhockenbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzYyNTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/30037f49efb3d3b48b3f0216c4e7d10d1502e715/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T02:13:04Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T02:13:04Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"message":"makefile: dev-down catches Vite''s children reliably\n\nPrevious dev-down sent SIGTERM to the recorded PID (and tried negated-\nPID for process-group reach). Vite leaked because:\n- npm exits as soon as it forwards the signal, becoming an exited\n  process-group leader.\n- Once the leader exits and is reaped, Linux refuses `kill -- -pgid`\n  even though other members are still alive (the actual `node vite`\n  child reparented to init).\n\nTwo changes:\n\n1. dev-up runs each service via `setsid` so the recorded PID is also\n   the session leader / pgid. This is necessary for any group-based\n   reach in the first place.\n\n2. dev-down now enumerates the live members of each pgid via\n   `pgrep -g $pgid` *before* sending any signals, then xargs-kills\n   each member directly. No reliance on the leader still existing,\n   no race between SIGTERM and SIGKILL.\n\nVerified: `make dev-up; make dev-down` leaves zero processes for\nidp / outbox-worker / docs-api / vite. Previously vite''s `node`\nchild consistently survived.","tree":{"sha":"59ca398037fcf443d0b92c88f9bfef0d709cf5f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/trees/59ca398037fcf443d0b92c88f9bfef0d709cf5f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/commits/30037f49efb3d3b48b3f0216c4e7d10d1502e715","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury","id":2676257,"login":"mhockenbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzYyNTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/30037f49efb3d3b48b3f0216c4e7d10d1502e715","node_id":"C_kwDOSJFenNoAKDMwMDM3ZjQ5ZWZiM2QzYjQ4YjNmMDIxNmM0ZTdkMTBkMTUwMmU3MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/cf8460982c9c2e82af4d4ef5d6718687978c022b","sha":"cf8460982c9c2e82af4d4ef5d6718687978c022b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/cf8460982c9c2e82af4d4ef5d6718687978c022b"}],"sha":"30037f49efb3d3b48b3f0216c4e7d10d1502e715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/30037f49efb3d3b48b3f0216c4e7d10d1502e715"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury","id":2676257,"login":"mhockenbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzYyNTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/cf8460982c9c2e82af4d4ef5d6718687978c022b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T01:54:39Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T01:54:39Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"message":"makefile: prune obsolete dev-loop family\n\nRemove the older `up-app` / `down-app` / `restart-app` / `status-app` /\n`logs-*` / `up-all` / `down-all` family (and their `_start-proc` /\n`_stop-proc` / `_wait-deps` / `check-deps` helpers, plus `RUN_DIR` /\n`APPS` vars). All superseded by the newer `dev-up` / `dev-down` /\n`dev-status` / `dev-logs` / `dev-tail` family that uses /tmp/idp-*.log\ninstead of run/.\n\nAlso drop `run-idp` / `run-outbox-worker` / `run-docs-api` — the bare\n`go run ...` three-liners. `dev-up` covers the common case (background\nall four services); `dev-serve` covers foreground-IdP debugging.\n\nUpdate README §9 to teach the dev-up flow as the primary path.\n.gitignore: drop run/ (no longer used).\n\nNet: 42 → 29 targets, −104 lines.","tree":{"sha":"30692418dc55efd67a470b46d968008133e75e53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/trees/30692418dc55efd67a470b46d968008133e75e53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/commits/cf8460982c9c2e82af4d4ef5d6718687978c022b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury","id":2676257,"login":"mhockenbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzYyNTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/cf8460982c9c2e82af4d4ef5d6718687978c022b","node_id":"C_kwDOSJFenNoAKGNmODQ2MDk4MmM5YzJlODJhZjRkNGVmNWQ2NzE4Njg3OTc4YzAyMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/c0e70ef413adc9e39304f52c7c297adc3fbb0f00","sha":"c0e70ef413adc9e39304f52c7c297adc3fbb0f00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/c0e70ef413adc9e39304f52c7c297adc3fbb0f00"}],"sha":"cf8460982c9c2e82af4d4ef5d6718687978c022b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/cf8460982c9c2e82af4d4ef5d6718687978c022b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury","id":2676257,"login":"mhockenbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzYyNTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/c0e70ef413adc9e39304f52c7c297adc3fbb0f00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T01:49:26Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T01:49:26Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"message":"logging: tint pretty-format + tmux dev-tail\n\nAdd internal/logging.New: JSON by default, lmittmann/tint-colored\noutput when LOG_FORMAT=pretty. All three binaries (idp,\noutbox-worker, docs-api) route through it.\n\n`make dev-up` now exports LOG_FORMAT=pretty so backgrounded services\nwrite tint-formatted lines to /tmp/idp-*.log. Production / aggregation\ndeployments leave LOG_FORMAT unset and get the original JSON.\n\nReplace `make dev-tail`''s multitail backend with tmux. Multitail 6.5\nstrips bright-color SGR escapes (90s/100s range) which is exactly what\ntint emits for level letters; tmux renders them faithfully. Layout is\na tmux 2x2 grid with per-pane title borders. Ctrl-B d detaches without\nkilling the backgrounded services.\n\n`make dev-down` also gained a pgrep fallback to catch idp/outbox-worker/\ndocs-api processes whose PID files got out of sync from a half-failed\ndev-up.","tree":{"sha":"9a3fa284541a3cd90c459b355a028c210a8c4d20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/trees/9a3fa284541a3cd90c459b355a028c210a8c4d20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/commits/c0e70ef413adc9e39304f52c7c297adc3fbb0f00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury","id":2676257,"login":"mhockenbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzYyNTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/c0e70ef413adc9e39304f52c7c297adc3fbb0f00","node_id":"C_kwDOSJFenNoAKGMwZTcwZWY0MTNhZGM5ZTM5MzA0ZjUyYzdjMjk3YWRjM2ZiYjBmMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/8091a3b44261ee1d3115defbbd0f81f927ac76bd","sha":"8091a3b44261ee1d3115defbbd0f81f927ac76bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/8091a3b44261ee1d3115defbbd0f81f927ac76bd"}],"sha":"c0e70ef413adc9e39304f52c7c297adc3fbb0f00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/c0e70ef413adc9e39304f52c7c297adc3fbb0f00"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury","id":2676257,"login":"mhockenbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzYyNTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/8091a3b44261ee1d3115defbbd0f81f927ac76bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T01:15:07Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T01:15:07Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"message":"makefile: turnkey dev-up for all four services\n\n`make dev-up` brings up idp + outbox-worker + docs-api + vite as\nbackgrounded processes with logs in /tmp/idp-*.log and PIDs in\n/tmp/idp-*.pid. `make dev-down` stops them. `make dev-status` shows\nstate. `make dev-logs SVC=docs|idp|outbox|web` tails one log.\n\n`dev-all` now also runs `dev-fga` (idempotent OpenFGA store init) and\n`dev-seed-alice` (writes alice''s UUID to /tmp/idp-env). After a fresh\nclone: `make up && make migrate && make dev-all && make dev-up` and\nhttp://localhost:5173 is live.\n\nForeground `make dev-serve` (idp only) stays available for when you\nwant crashes to be obvious in your terminal.","tree":{"sha":"f54929a779c08424b5d00228001427ca7e6c353a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/trees/f54929a779c08424b5d00228001427ca7e6c353a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/commits/8091a3b44261ee1d3115defbbd0f81f927ac76bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury","id":2676257,"login":"mhockenbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzYyNTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/8091a3b44261ee1d3115defbbd0f81f927ac76bd","node_id":"C_kwDOSJFenNoAKDgwOTFhM2I0NDI2MWVlMWQzMTE1ZGVmYmJkMGY4MWY5MjdhYzc2YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/756e3a53450d510211a59a789366ed56af71093f","sha":"756e3a53450d510211a59a789366ed56af71093f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/756e3a53450d510211a59a789366ed56af71093f"}],"sha":"8091a3b44261ee1d3115defbbd0f81f927ac76bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/8091a3b44261ee1d3115defbbd0f81f927ac76bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury","id":2676257,"login":"mhockenbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzYyNTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/756e3a53450d510211a59a789366ed56af71093f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T01:14:52Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T01:14:52Z","email":"me@matthockenbury.com","name":"Matt Hockenbury"},"message":"oauth: RFC 8707 resource indicators + two-client SPA model\n\nAccess tokens now carry aud=<resource-server>, not aud=<client_id>. The\nSPA splits across two OAuth clients so each tree gets a token bound to\nthe right resource:\n\n  • localdev-docs  → resource=docs-api,  scopes openid+email+read:docs+write:docs\n  • localdev-admin → resource=idp-admin, scopes openid+email+admin\n\nID tokens still use aud=<client_id> per OIDC Core (the ID token is *for*\nthe client to consume; the access token is *for* the resource server).\n/userinfo is a deliberate exception with no aud check — Auth0/Okta/Google\nall behave the same way; the issuer is serving the endpoint, so iss +\nsignature + scope=openid is what matters.\n\nSchema (migration 0004):\n- clients.resources TEXT[]      — RFC 8707 allowlist per client\n- auth_codes.resource TEXT      — captured at /authorize, becomes aud\n- refresh_tokens.resource TEXT  — preserved across rotation\n\n/authorize now requires both `scope=` and `resource=` explicitly; no\nimplicit fallbacks, so audit logs always show what was asked for.\n\nSPA: per-tree <AuthProvider> with namespaced sessionStorage prefixes\n(oidc.docs:, oidc.admin:) so concurrent PKCE/state/nonce don''t collide.\nDistinct callback paths (/callback vs /admin/callback) disambiguate\nwhich provider completes the post-/authorize redirect.\n\nThree drive-bys folded in:\n- outbox-worker defaults OPENFGA_API_URL to http://localhost:8081 to\n  match idp + docs-api (no more \"OPENFGA_API_URL is required\" footgun).\n- seed_client.sql gains the two new clients; localdev kept for the\n  curl smoke scripts.\n- dev_flow.sh + docs_smoke.sh now pass resource=docs-api.\n\nReplaces the docs/tradeoffs.md \"aud=client_id shortcut\" entry with a\nfull RFC 8707 + two-client write-up.","tree":{"sha":"8462f206dbf09605a8fc266e465c7c4f6c8b3a99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/trees/8462f206dbf09605a8fc266e465c7c4f6c8b3a99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/git/commits/756e3a53450d510211a59a789366ed56af71093f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2676257?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury","id":2676257,"login":"mhockenbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzYyNTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhockenbury","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/756e3a53450d510211a59a789366ed56af71093f","node_id":"C_kwDOSJFenNoAKDc1NmUzYTUzNDUwZDUxMDIxMWE1OWE3ODkzNjZlZDU2YWY3MTA5M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commit/4e96705874f9a9b5693291e0487e0091b20be0c3","sha":"4e96705874f9a9b5693291e0487e0091b20be0c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mhockenbury/identity-provider/commits/4e96705874f9a9b5693291e0487e0091b20be0c3"}],"sha":"756e3a53450d510211a59a789366ed56af71093f","url":"h