ub.com/users/Aukevanoost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/playground/commits/21c42d92a8d5e8243269504a1c27da39ac7b2b90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:25:19Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:25:19Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"refactor(tractor-store): simplify architecture around one shared library\n\n- Merge event-bus, navigation, url, ui and federation libs into libs/shared\n  (@tractor-store/shared); drop the unused logging lib. startFederation lives\n  under its own alias (@tractor-store/start) because main.ts runs before the\n  import map exists.\n- Replace per-remote plumbing (env config, loader token, shared injector,\n  ResourceService, feature bootstraps, main.ts) with startFederation,\n  defineRemoteApp().expose() and a single ENV / LOAD_REMOTE token.\n- Collapse NavRegistry + shell-nav setup into provideRemoteNavigation; share\n  resolveIntentUrl between host and NavigateToDirective. Bus channels are\n  resolved lazily, nav:navigate is not replayed, nav:intents is a latched\n  resource, listenTo() handles unsubscribing.\n- Load remote elements declaratively via [mfeRemote]; rewrite\n  RemoteShellComponent with signals and resource(); use NgOptimizedImage with\n  a CDN image loader; ShadowDom only on exposed elements; immutable CartStore.\n- Drop the unused env `scope` field and update docs.","tree":{"sha":"3337598bad162eb0a909a0b48d4b4a0f620c6a37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/playground/git/trees/3337598bad162eb0a909a0b48d4b4a0f620c6a37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/playground/git/commits/21c42d92a8d5e8243269504a1c27da39ac7b2b90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":