{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47603738?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/meowrhino","id":47603738,"login":"meowrhino","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjAzNzM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meowrhino/polroig2/commits/a58a107ad8d04e95d19028cea90aa79552d76566/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T08:07:53Z","email":"manuellatourf@gmail.com","name":"manu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T08:07:53Z","email":"manuellatourf@gmail.com","name":"manu"},"message":"initial commit: polroig2\n\nVanilla SPA fork of polroig with a different home layout — big circular\nmirilla on the larger side (2/3) and an organically-scattered cloud of\nproject names on the smaller side (1/3). Clicking a name swaps the\nmirilla via an iris-pulse animation; clicking the mirilla opens the\nproject page.\n\n- `ruleta` dropped from the data schema — any `visible: true` project\n  shows in the cloud; hidden ones are also filtered out of the router.\n- `--pad-x: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 6rem)` and desktop gap mirrors it for a\n  balanced `pad | stage | gap | side | pad` rhythm; `--max-w: 1600px`\n  caps content on ultra-wide screens.\n- Cloud height is stable: the project-info row reserves the tallest\n  synopsis+bio so the cloud doesn''t jump between projects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0dad97f43337413c0cedcfeeece990e18416e86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meowrhino/polroig2/git/trees/a0dad97f43337413c0cedcfeeece990e18416e86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meowrhino/polroig2/git/commits/a58a107ad8d04e95d19028cea90aa79552d76566","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47603738?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/meowrhino","id":47603738,"login":"meowrhino","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjAzNzM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowrhino","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/meowrhino/polroig2/commit/a58a107ad8d04e95d19028cea90aa79552d76566","node_id":"C_kwDOSJX5SNoAKGE1OGExMDdhZDhkMDRlOTVkMTkwMjhjZWE5MGFhNzk1NTJkNzY1NjY","parents":[],"sha":"a58a107ad8d04e95d19028cea90aa79552d76566","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/meowrhino/polroig2/commits/a58a107ad8d04e95d19028cea90aa79552d76566"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/meowrhino/polroig2/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=9336cf1a37b84b23fd7e888bd90ef428a2591f3c&since=2025-03-31T23%3A5