wner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sukabubu/erxes/commits/ff28842074422a7c5dae6f0f27ff0101f451a853/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T08:58:28Z","email":"104069564+Wlkr123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuguldur"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T08:58:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(automations): enhance builder UX, AI agent tooling, and core actions (#7441)\n\n* feat: Add AiAgentRuntimeForm and AutomationAiAgentHealthSection components\n\n- Implemented AiAgentRuntimeForm for configuring AI agent runtime parameters including temperature, max tokens, and timeout.\n- Created AutomationAiAgentHealthSection to display health status of AI agents, including readiness and error/warning messages.\n- Removed obsolete AutomationAiAgentProgressSection, AutomationAiAgentTestChatSection, and AutomationAiAgentTrainingWrapper components.\n- Updated GraphQL queries and mutations to reflect new AI agent structure and health checks.\n- Enhanced AiAgentFormSchema to include connection, runtime, and context configurations.\n- Improved user interface for direct message triggers in Facebook automation, clarifying conditions and descriptions.\n\n* feat: enhance AI agent memory management and UI components\n\n- Implemented memory read/write functionality in AI agent forms.\n- Added file upload limits and improved file handling in context forms.\n- Updated file icons and UI for better user experience in file lists.\n- Introduced new API key management features in the AI agent connection form.\n- Enhanced settings sidebar and constants for automation paths.\n- Created backend memory store for AI actions with proper schema and indexing.\n- Added memory fields in AI agent actions to facilitate result persistence.\n\n* feat: Enhance automation variable handling and input suggestions\n\n- Added support for selected nodes in AutomationContextType with state management.\n- Introduced new GraphQL query for fetching automation node outputs.\n- Implemented node click event handling to update selected node state.\n- Enhanced PlaceholderInput component to support drag-and-drop for automation variables.\n- Updated various command lists to improve UI and accessibility.\n- Introduced dynamic enabling/disabling of suggestion types in placeholder inputs.\n- Created utility functions for handling automation variable drag-and-drop operations.\n- Refactored suggestion popover components for better structure and usability.\n\n* feat: Enhance file upload and management in automation settings\n\n- Refactor DropFilesZone to support new file structure and upload handling.\n- Update FilesList to display additional file information and handle file clicks.\n- Integrate AiAgentContextFileEditorDialog for editing uploaded files.\n- Modify AiAgentContextForm to manage file uploads and deletions more effectively.\n- Introduce new utility functions for context file management.\n- Implement drag-and-drop functionality for automation variable blocks and CodeMirror.\n- Add runtime summary for AI agents to provide insights on configuration limits.\n- Update automation variable handling to improve user experience in the editor.\n- Enhance automation history tracking with additional fields for action duration and status.\n\n* feat: Enhance FindObject action and Outgoing Webhook components\n\n- Updated FindObjectConfigForm to use objectType and lookupField instead of propertyType and propertyField.\n- Improved FindObjectNodeContent to display record type and value correctly.\n- Refactored OutgoingWebhook components to support body mode (JSON/Text) and improved validation for webhook URLs.\n- Enhanced OutgoingWebhookBodyBuilder to conditionally render input based on body mode.\n- Removed unnecessary header type selection in OutgoingWebhookHeaders.\n- Updated outgoingWebhookFormSchema to include bodyMode and validate webhook URLs.\n- Refactored useFormSetValue to ensure proper synchronization of form values.\n- Updated AutomationProvider to use findObjectTargetsConst instead of propertyTypesConst.\n- Improved overall code structure and readability across affected components.\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in eee2542 according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/7441\n\n* feat: Enhance AI action parser and OpenAI request handling; add webhook placeholder validation\n\n* feat: Enhance error handling and sensitive data masking in webhook processes; refactor AI agent connection logic\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in 2368f0a according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/7441\n\n* refactor: Improve type safety and consistency across automation modules; update type definitions and enhance handling of unknown values\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in 914526a according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/7441\n\n* fix: Correct key name from ''incoming_webhook'' to ''webhooks'' in WebhooksComponents\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in 3428832 according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/7441\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: deepsource-autofix[bot] <62050782+deepsource-autofix[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"20a0d83c948ce63b282c29fbc5ef5e8b1f73a92a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sukabubu/erxes/git/trees/20a0d83c948ce63b282c29fbc5ef5e8b1f73a92a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sukabubu/erxes/git/commits/ff28842074422a7c5dae6f0f27ff0101f451a853","verification":{"payload":"tree 20a0d83c948ce63b282c29fbc5ef5e8b1