omation variables.\n- Updated various command lists to improve UI and accessibility.\n- Introduced dynamic enabling/disabling of suggestion types in placeholder inputs.\n- Created utility functions for handling automation variable drag-and-drop operations.\n- Refactored suggestion popover components for better structure and usability.\n\n* feat: Enhance file upload and management in automation settings\n\n- Refactor DropFilesZone to support new file structure and upload handling.\n- Update FilesList to display additional file information and handle file clicks.\n- Integrate AiAgentContextFileEditorDialog for editing uploaded files.\n- Modify AiAgentContextForm to manage file uploads and deletions more effectively.\n- Introduce new utility functions for context file management.\n- Implement drag-and-drop functionality for automation variable blocks and CodeMirror.\n- Add runtime summary for AI agents to provide insights on configuration limits.\n- Update automation variable handling to improve user experience in the editor.\n- Enhance automation history tracking with additional fields for action duration and status.\n\n* feat: Enhance FindObject action and Outgoing Webhook components\n\n- Updated FindObjectConfigForm to use objectType and lookupField instead of propertyType and propertyField.\n- Improved FindObjectNodeContent to display record type and value correctly.\n- Refactored OutgoingWebhook components to support body mode (JSON/Text) and improved validation for webhook URLs.\n- Enhanced OutgoingWebhookBodyBuilder to conditionally render input based on body mode.\n- Removed unnecessary header type selection in OutgoingWebhookHeaders.\n- Updated outgoingWebhookFormSchema to include bodyMode and validate webhook URLs.\n- Refactored useFormSetValue to ensure proper synchronization of form values.\n- Updated AutomationProvider to use findObjectTargetsConst instead of propertyTypesConst.\n- Improved overall code structure and readability across affected components.