Contract lifecycle management\n\n  Removals:\n  - Administration/Support capability and its three services (Service desk,\n    Support page, Ticketing system) — folder tree deleted\n  - Security/CSIRT capability and its two services (Incident response,\n    Threat monitoring) — folder tree deleted\n  - Governance/Contract management/License asset service — folder deleted\n  - Governance/Contract management/Contract establishment service — replaced\n\n  Additions:\n  - Administration/Notification and messaging/Messaging service — formalises\n    the existing Kafka message-broker substrate\n  - Integration/Resource discovery/Marketplace service — governed commercial\n    exchange environment for federated resource procurement\n  - Governance/Contract management/Contract lifecycle management service —\n    replaces Contract establishment; covers full contract lifecycle from\n    template authoring through activation, renewal, and termination\n\n  Renames:\n  - governance/contract-management/contract-establishment/ →\n    contract-lifecycle-management/ (all solutions moved with folder)\n\n  Documentation:\n  - capability-map.md Level 1 and Level 2 narratives updated throughout\n  - MAPPING.md, both mapping ledgers, README.md, cross-cutting agents and\n    libs, security and integration architecture docs, foundations\n    interoperability and API catalogue, BP07 dynamic view, notification\n    service, and all solution READMEs updated — no stale references remain","tree":{"sha":"4e5500ec7b9ad46010a4a84d43fbc595830e0cbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barrynauta/simpl-repo-tryout/git/trees/4e5500ec7b9ad46010a4a84d43fbc595830e0cbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barrynauta/simpl-repo-tryout/git/commits/fa7a1c499394d038b58abe002e417280ab2cbeb4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11227704?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.co