ers/Chi-hab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Chi-hab","id":226332206,"login":"Chi-hab","node_id":"U_kgDODX2OLg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Chi-hab/field-service-management/commit/563ba06abcb0b22916aca45d7307d1ad0090fdbe","node_id":"C_kwDOSJmMutoAKDU2M2JhMDZhYmNiMGIyMjkxNmFjYTQ1ZDczMDdkMWFkMDA5MGZkYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Chi-hab/field-service-management/commit/38a16267ac2abcc5d8ccbc8378348863b0977db3","sha":"38a16267ac2abcc5d8ccbc8378348863b0977db3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chi-hab/field-service-management/commits/38a16267ac2abcc5d8ccbc8378348863b0977db3"}],"sha":"563ba06abcb0b22916aca45d7307d1ad0090fdbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chi-hab/field-service-management/commits/563ba06abcb0b22916aca45d7307d1ad0090fdbe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226332206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Chi-hab","id":226332206,"login":"Chi-hab","node_id":"U_kgDODX2OLg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chi-hab/field-service-management/commits/38a16267ac2abcc5d8ccbc8378348863b0977db3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T13:02:19Z","email":"jackpilo24@gmail.com","name":"Chi-hab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T13:02:19Z","email":"jackpilo24@gmail.com","name":"Chi-hab"},"message":"Scaffold FSM (Django REST + React + docker-compose)\n\nBackend (Django 5, DRF, Postgres, Redis, Celery):\n- Custom User with role enum (ADMIN/DISPATCHER/TECHNICIAN/CUSTOMER).\n- Apps: accounts, customers, inventory, workorders, timelogs, audit,\n  notifications, common.\n- Nested writable serializers for WorkOrder (tasks/assignments/part\n  usages) with atomic create/update + child sync.\n- ModelViewSets + custom actions (/assign, /start, /complete, /cancel,\n  /tasks/<id>/complete). Generic / action-scoped throttling\n  (auth/read/write/heavy-report).\n- RBAC via custom permission classes + row-level scoping in\n  get_queryset.\n- django-filter FilterSets + SearchFilter + OrderingFilter +\n  PageNumberPagination; select_related / prefetch_related on list/detail.\n- Redis cache with cache_page + vary_on_headers(Authorization) and\n  versioned keys invalidated by post_save/post_delete signals.\n- Simple JWT (rotating refresh + blacklist), role-aware token payload.\n- Celery worker + beat: send_notification, scan_sla_breaches,\n  geocode_location stub. django_celery_beat DB scheduler.\n- drf-spectacular OpenAPI at /api/schema, Swagger /api/docs, ReDoc.\n- JSON logging, RFC-7807-flavored exception handler, AuditLog\n  middleware, HTTPS/HSTS hardened prod settings.\n- seed_demo management command (admin/dispatcher/tech/customer,\n  pw demo1234) + pytest smoke tests.\n\nFrontend (React 18, Vite, TS, Tailwind, shadcn-style primitives):\n- Axios instance with request (attach access) + response (auto-refresh\n  with in-flight queue) interceptors. Tokens in localStorage.\n- React Router: ProtectedRoute + RoleRoute wrappers.\n- React Query for server state, Redux Toolkit authSlice for auth.\n- Pages: Login, Dashboard, WorkOrders list + detail (start/complete/\n  cancel + per-task mark-done), Customers, Parts.\n- shadcn-style Button/Input/Label/Card/Badge primitives; responsive\n  layout with role-scoped sidebar nav.\n\nInfra:\n- docker-compose orchestrates db (postgres:16), redis, backend,\n  worker, beat, frontend (Vite dev).\n- GitHub Actions CI: ruff + Django check + pytest for backend; tsc +\n  vitest + vite build for frontend.\n- .env.example at root + per-service, README + docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.","tree":{"sha":"b97021e2bf1eb06ca992e16c7ccb3fd8e9cb9f20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chi-hab/field-service-management/git/trees/b97021e2bf1eb06ca992e16c7ccb3fd8e9cb9f20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chi-hab/field-service-management/git/commits/38a16267ac2abcc5d8ccbc8378348863b0977db3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226332206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Chi-hab","id":226332206,"login":"Chi-hab","node_id":"U_kgDODX2OLg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chi-hab/received_eve