 files with Mermaid diagrams covering: overview, installation,\n  system architecture, user guide, agent system, API reference, semantic layer,\n  workflow engine, security & RBAC, extending with new micro-apps,\n  troubleshooting, and comprehensive sequence diagrams for all major flows\n\nTests (backend/tests/):\n- conftest.py: pytest fixtures with in-memory SQLite (no SQL Server needed)\n- unit/test_guardrails.py: injection detection, SQL guard, PII redaction\n- unit/test_auth.py: password hashing, JWT issue/verify, complexity rules\n- integration/test_api_auth.py: login, MFA, refresh, protected endpoints\n- integration/test_api_incidents.py: create, list, resolve incident flows\n- pyproject.toml: pytest/mypy/ruff/coverage configuration\n- requirements.txt: add aiosqlite and pytest-cov\n\nFrontend tests (frontend/src/__tests__/):\n- GlobalSearch.test.tsx: type metadata, fetch gating, keyboard navigation, Ctrl+K\n- NotificationDrawer.test.tsx: unread count, type colours, nav guard, mark-all-read\n- vite.config.ts: add vitest test block with jsdom environment\n\nOnboarding (frontend/src/platform/components/Onboarding/):\n- OnboardingTour.tsx: Shepherd.js guided tour with role-based step sets\n  (engineer: 6 steps, dept_admin: 9 steps, plant_admin: 11 steps)\n  auto-starts on first login, localStorage persistence, re-triggerable\n\nCI (.github/workflows/ci.yml):\n- 5 jobs: backend-lint, backend-test, frontend-lint, frontend-test, frontend-build\n- Python 3.12 + Node 20, pip/npm caching, artifact uploads, concurrency cancel\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01LpyXoKiXZRdNxzKWbMjv9k","tree":{"sha":"d3d040d906df1e2b298f6796b0e6c515ef31deff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Indominus77/RCA/git/trees/d3d040d906df1e2b298f6796b0e6c515ef31deff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Indominus77/RCA/git/commits/89bdcfd08eb5422bcc23cc766b4b42a86cc95f2b","verification":{"payload":"tree d3d040d906df1e2b298f6796b0e6c515ef31deff\nparent 50eddb1bceda55a2e1273c268c660e881e57eb40\na