"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/29ba818f91e0ca63242ce2cda5f0292a3484b204/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T14:21:28Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T14:21:41Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"message":"Rename to Axiom, set the wordmark in IBM Plex Sans\n\nWordmark is now text alone in IBM Plex Sans, with the check-mark logo removed.\nProduct-name occurrences become Axiom; \"protocol\" as the domain noun for a\ngenerated plan is left alone, as are the ProtocolView / ProtocolSession\nidentifiers and the /protocol route.\n\nAlso corrects two published counts the conformance check flagged: the catalog\nholds 1,324 exercises, not 873, and 346 of them carry direct evidence, not 345.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bef4dc9dec9316af57638b8a50707203e784640","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/trees/3bef4dc9dec9316af57638b8a50707203e784640"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/commits/29ba818f91e0ca63242ce2cda5f0292a3484b204","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93215707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq","id":93215707,"login":"adnanhq","node_id":"U_kgDOBY5b2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commit/29ba818f91e0ca63242ce2cda5f0292a3484b204","node_id":"C_kwDOSJvHKtoAKDI5YmE4MThmOTFlMGNhNjMyNDJjZTJjZGE1ZjAyOTJhMzQ4NGIyMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commit/5987e9270a248d415287491bba7ef4537ef4c365","sha":"5987e9270a248d415287491bba7ef4537ef4c365","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/5987e9270a248d415287491bba7ef4537ef4c365"}],"sha":"29ba818f91e0ca63242ce2cda5f0292a3484b204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/29ba818f91e0ca63242ce2cda5f0292a3484b204"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93215707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq","id":93215707,"login":"adnanhq","node_id":"U_kgDOBY5b2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/5987e9270a248d415287491bba7ef4537ef4c365/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T14:21:28Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T14:21:28Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"message":"Scope the semantic query, run the citation check, align the appendix\n\nThree fixes the audit surfaced, all covered by the existing suite:\n\nSemantic query carries only the target muscles, goal and user notes. Session\ncount, split template, equipment and candidate exercise names described how a\nplan is laid out rather than what to retrieve. Measured over 49 labelled topic\nqueries, the scoped form reaches nDCG@10 0.215 on held-out queries against 0.091\nfor the full field list, p = 0.0088, with citation yield unchanged at 86%.\n\nCitation containment now runs on every generation rather than only in tests. It\nreturns a list and never raises, so it cannot alter output; results land in the\ndebug payload pending a false-positive rate measured on live output.\n\nThe API''s evidence appendix merges each exercise''s reference_evidence alongside\ncorpus findings, matching the Markdown export, so the study count covers every\nPMID the response displays.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa29b5c1b5c25bb5f74fb1cc048b8fdba9d545bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/trees/fa29b5c1b5c25bb5f74fb1cc048b8fdba9d545bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/commits/5987e9270a248d415287491bba7ef4537ef4c365","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93215707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq","id":93215707,"login":"adnanhq","node_id":"U_kgDOBY5b2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commit/5987e9270a248d415287491bba7ef4537ef4c365","node_id":"C_kwDOSJvHKtoAKDU5ODdlOTI3MGEyNDhkNDE1Mjg3NDkxYmJhN2VmNDUzN2VmNGMzNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commit/bae20d408412d4b437e1822a4a10f69e74f4e998","sha":"bae20d408412d4b437e1822a4a10f69e74f4e998","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/bae20d408412d4b437e1822a4a10f69e74f4e998"}],"sha":"5987e9270a248d415287491bba7ef4537ef4c365","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/5987e9270a248d415287491bba7ef4537ef4c365"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93215707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq","id":93215707,"login":"adnanhq","node_id":"U_kgDOBY5b2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/bae20d408412d4b437e1822a4a10f69e74f4e998/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T14:21:28Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T14:21:28Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"message":"Add stage-wise grounding audit harness\n\nEvaluation harness for the CSE498R paper. Measures the evidence pipeline stage\nby stage against ground truth the pipeline already produces: MEDLINE publication\ntypes label study design, and the boolean query that fetched each study serves as\na relevance label, so three of the four stages need no manual annotation.\n\nAdditive only. The harness imports the engine''s real functions and audits them in\nplace; nothing outside research/ is written. The deterministic stages reproduce\nbyte-identically across runs and every result file records its package versions\nand sampling seed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"730ac0538d76f0a10ba5c5c716daab0e4da30dfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/trees/730ac0538d76f0a10ba5c5c716daab0e4da30dfd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/commits/bae20d408412d4b437e1822a4a10f69e74f4e998","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93215707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq","id":93215707,"login":"adnanhq","node_id":"U_kgDOBY5b2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commit/bae20d408412d4b437e1822a4a10f69e74f4e998","node_id":"C_kwDOSJvHKtoAKGJhZTIwZDQwODQxMmQ0YjQzN2UxODIyYTRhMTBmNjllNzRmNGU5OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commit/881710295b615516b6101b942ba0dcdfddcd4cc3","sha":"881710295b615516b6101b942ba0dcdfddcd4cc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/881710295b615516b6101b942ba0dcdfddcd4cc3"}],"sha":"bae20d408412d4b437e1822a4a10f69e74f4e998","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/bae20d408412d4b437e1822a4a10f69e74f4e998"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93215707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq","id":93215707,"login":"adnanhq","node_id":"U_kgDOBY5b2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/881710295b615516b6101b942ba0dcdfddcd4cc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T20:38:06Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T20:38:06Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"message":"Accept Vercel preview origins via ALLOWED_ORIGIN_REGEX\n\nRenaming the Vercel domain to protocol-demo-cse499.vercel.app left the\nengine''s exact-match allowlist pointing at the old host, so every\nbrowser call was answered with \"400 Disallowed CORS origin\" — which the\nweb app reports as \"Couldn''t reach the protocol engine\". Fixed live by\nupdating ALLOWED_ORIGINS on Railway; this stops it recurring.\n\nVercel names every deployment project-<hash>-<scope>.vercel.app, so\npreview builds can never be enumerated in ALLOWED_ORIGINS. Pass a regex\nto CORSMiddleware alongside the exact list, defaulting to this project''s\nproduction + preview hosts. Anchored at both ends so\nprotocol-demo-cse499.vercel.app.evil.com and plain http:// don''t match.\n\nAlso documents CORS as the usual deploy break, with the one-line curl\nthat tells you whether it''s the engine or the allowlist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd72e41057c2163455588cf663dc3ee2f3e4181c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/trees/bd72e41057c2163455588cf663dc3ee2f3e4181c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/commits/881710295b615516b6101b942ba0dcdfddcd4cc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93215707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq","id":93215707,"login":"adnanhq","node_id":"U_kgDOBY5b2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commit/881710295b615516b6101b942ba0dcdfddcd4cc3","node_id":"C_kwDOSJvHKtoAKDg4MTcxMDI5NWI2MTU1MTZiNjEwMWI5NDJiYTBkY2RmZGRjZDRjYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commit/5349dfc96780dd525a4c7d21645b9030cbc07473","sha":"5349dfc96780dd525a4c7d21645b9030cbc07473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/5349dfc96780dd525a4c7d21645b9030cbc07473"}],"sha":"881710295b615516b6101b942ba0dcdfddcd4cc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/881710295b615516b6101b942ba0dcdfddcd4cc3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93215707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq","id":93215707,"login":"adnanhq","node_id":"U_kgDOBY5b2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/5349dfc96780dd525a4c7d21645b9030cbc07473/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T20:20:18Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T20:20:18Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"message":"Recolour protocol surfaces teal, lift the hero grid\n\nThe generated-protocol card and the per-session split bands were\nnear-black (#0b0f12) with the indigo-tinted aurora behind them, which\nread heavy next to the rest of the page.\n\n- New teal surface tokens a shade under the button accent\n  (#0b5e57 card, #0e6b62 session bands) plus an on-teal text ramp; the\n  cool-grey on-dark ramp goes dull against teal, so muted/subtle text\n  is now teal-tinted and still clears AA.\n- `teal-sheen` replaces `aurora` on these surfaces (the indigo radial\n  muddies against teal) and `glass-teal` gives the pills and toolbar\n  buttons a bit more lift than the 5% dark glass did.\n- Toolbar''s primary action goes white-on-teal; it was mint-on-near-black.\n- Hero''s hairline grid alpha 0.035 → 0.055 so the texture actually\n  reads on the new light background.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6cad9da64772ec5fc6fe7527afe76dbff256a63b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/trees/6cad9da64772ec5fc6fe7527afe76dbff256a63b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/commits/5349dfc96780dd525a4c7d21645b9030cbc07473","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93215707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq","id":93215707,"login":"adnanhq","node_id":"U_kgDOBY5b2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commit/5349dfc96780dd525a4c7d21645b9030cbc07473","node_id":"C_kwDOSJvHKtoAKDUzNDlkZmM5Njc4MGRkNTI1YTRjN2QyMTY0NWI5MDMwY2JjMDc0NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commit/ba532b03c66a26a7c01075d58b7646777f02aa7b","sha":"ba532b03c66a26a7c01075d58b7646777f02aa7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/ba532b03c66a26a7c01075d58b7646777f02aa7b"}],"sha":"5349dfc96780dd525a4c7d21645b9030cbc07473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/5349dfc96780dd525a4c7d21645b9030cbc07473"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93215707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq","id":93215707,"login":"adnanhq","node_id":"U_kgDOBY5b2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commits/ba532b03c66a26a7c01075d58b7646777f02aa7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T20:07:42Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T20:07:42Z","email":"adnan.haque1210@gmail.com","name":"adnanhq"},"message":"Rebuild hero: light, minimal, and plainly says what the product is\n\nFaculty review flagged two things about the landing hero: the dark\nblack/green two-tone band read as packed and clunky, and the headline\n(\"Every set in your program, cited.\") didn''t tell a first-time visitor\nwhat the product actually is.\n\n- Hero is now a light, centered, type-only band on white — one soft\n  accent wash plus the existing hairline grid, no aurora or dark surface.\n- Headline states the product: \"Your workout plan, built from\n  peer-reviewed research\", with an eyebrow that names the category\n  (\"Evidence-based workout builder\") above it and a lede that walks\n  through input → output.\n- Dropped the EvidenceTrace pipeline graphic and the hero footnote\n  register; the corpus ticker and stat band below already carry the\n  citation proof. CTA-band footnote renumbered 2 → 1 now that it is the\n  page''s only one.\n- Secondary CTA points at the live sample protocol (new #sample anchor)\n  so the artifact is one click away.\n- Header loses its inverted on-dark mode (nothing dark sits under it any\n  more) and its CTA matches the hero''s \"Build your plan\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3dd2ac399fc07bb142a6514bae48a8168844143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/trees/c3dd2ac399fc07bb142a6514bae48a8168844143"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/git/commits/ba532b03c66a26a7c01075d58b7646777f02aa7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93215707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq","id":93215707,"login":"adnanhq","node_id":"U_kgDOBY5b2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adnanhq","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adnanhq/evidence-backed-workout-planner/commit/ba532b03c66a26a7c01075d58b764