CE-Nexus-Monorepo/commits/1df162f3419f074483fc68c78b5f49d0800e35a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T00:06:17Z","email":"abelnavarrete3010@hotmail.com","name":"Abel Navarrete"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T00:07:11Z","email":"abelnavarrete3010@hotmail.com","name":"Abel Navarrete"},"message":"fix(qa): fix chatbot MFE remote URL + geocampus env vars in prod compose\n\nBUG-02: web-host vite.config was hardcoding chatbot remote to http://localhost:5003\nwhich gets baked into the production bundle, causing ChatWidget to fail to load in QA.\nFixed to use relative path /chatbot-mf/assets/remoteEntry.js (same pattern as web-campus).\n\nBUG-03B: ms-01-gateway was missing GEOCAMPUS_SERVICE_URL in docker-compose.prod.yml\ncausing the /api/geocampus/* and /ws/geocampus proxy routes in the Gateway to fail.\nAdded GEOCAMPUS_SERVICE_URL=http://ms-09-geocampus:8009.\n\nBUG-03C: ms-09-geocampus had MQTT_HOST=localhost in prod compose instead of the\nDB_PRIVATE_IP, preventing the service from connecting to the Mosquitto broker on\nthe separate DB server.\nFixed to MQTT_HOST=${DB_PRIVATE_IP:-localhost}.","tree":{"sha":"3dfb9567796001bae01667c08b977221a555ec09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sarlacc3010/UCE-Nexus-Monorepo/git/trees/3dfb9567796001bae01667c08b977221a555ec09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sarlacc3010/UCE-Nexus-Monorepo/git/commits/1df162f3419f074483fc68c78b5f49d0800e35a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138503991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarlacc3010/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarlacc3010/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarlacc3010/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarlacc3010/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sarlacc3010","id":138503991,"log